INFO 09-15 16:07:41 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-45f62e152db348ec8fe132beb6190ce2-0: prompt: 'Wukong strolled into the room, a wicked grin spreading across his face as he eyed the caged MK. "It\'s time to play," he announced, reaching for the door of the cage.\n\nMacaque stepped forward, his newfound confidence and strength evident in the way he held himself. "You won\'t be taking him anywhere," he growled.\n\nWukong snorted. "And who\'s going to stop me? You?" he jeered, taking a step closer.\n\nMacaque\'s eyes glinted with power as he raised his hand, sending a bolt of lightning crackling through the air towards Wukong. The monkey king dodged easily, cackling with glee.\n\n"Well, well, well," he said, circling around Macaque. "Looks like you\'ve got a little bit of your mojo back. Not enough to beat me, though."\n\nMacaque bristled, preparing to strike again, but Wukong was too fast. In a blur of motion, he darted past Macaque and grabbed hold of MK, pulling him roughly out of the cage.\n\nMK struggled, but Wukong\'s grip was like iron. Macaque lunged forward, but Wukong kicked out, catching him in the chest and sending him reeling backwards.\n\nAs Wukong dragged MK out of the room, Macaque watched helplessly, his heart heavy with regret. "I\'m sorry," he muttered under his breath. "I\'m so sorry."', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=45, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 236824, 1490, 797, 234447, 1131, 506, 2978, 236764, 496, 53154, 73935, 30272, 3418, 914, 3392, 618, 668, 111127, 506, 215237, 42372, 236761, 623, 1509, 236789, 236751, 990, 531, 1441, 2098, 668, 7735