                +----------------+\n| Referral       |                       |   Offerwall    |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Player Wallet  |                       | Confirmation   |\n+----------------+                       |   of Transaction|\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Merchant       |                       |    Game        |\n| Reporting      |                       +----------------+\n+----------------+\n```\n* Users table: Stores information about the users of the system.\n* Geolocation table: Stores the geographical location of the user.\n* Transactions table: Stores information about transactions made by users.\n* Points table: Stores the points earned by users.\n* Bonus Retries table: Stores information about bonus retries.\n* Merchant Credit table: Stores information about the merchant's credit.\n* Bank Linked table: Stores information about the user's bank account linked to the system.\n* Referral Program table: Stores information about the referral program.\n* Player Wallet table: Stores information about the user's wallet.\n* Offer Status table: Stores information about the status of the offers.\n* Transaction Date table: Stores information about the date of the transaction.\n* Points Earned table: Stores information about the points earned by the user.\n* Merchant Reporting table: Stores information about the merchant's reporting.\n* Campaign Type table: Stores information about the type of campaign.\n* Credit Reward Campaign table: Stores information about the credit reward campaign.\n* Cash Reward Campaign table: Stores information about the cash reward campaign.\n* Dynamic Odds System table: Stores information about the dynamic odds system.\n* Offerwall table: Stores information about the offerwall.\n* Confirmation of Transaction table: Stores information about the confirmation of the transaction.\n* Game table: Stores information about the games available in the system.\n* Payment Provider table: Stores information about the payment providers integrated with the system.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=16, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 8291, 563, 496, 7426, 10065, 607, 496, 2822, 6492, 529, 506, 13792, 1534, 506, 11740, 236787, 107, 2717, 9275, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 236862, 2819, 236862, 107, 236909, 139, 13465, 144, 236909, 236743, 2819, 30104, 1109, 140, 208371, 142, 236909, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 236862, 2819, 236862, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 815, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 236862, 2819, 236862, 107, 236909, 139, 145370, 138, 236909, 159, 236909, 139, 27932, 142, 236909, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 236909, 139, 9629, 141, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 236862, 2819, 236862, 107, 236909, 51850, 139, 236909, 159, 236909, 139, 96550, 141, 236909, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 236909, 141, 2328, 143, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 143, 236909, 167, 147, 236909, 107, 236862, 2819, 236862, 159, 2