 20%|██        | 200/1000 [01:00<04:15,  3.13it/s]INFO 09-15 16:07:56 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-42af5cd9f91d4e17b217e3a38efc8904-0: prompt: "It's okay to take the time off that you need to focus on your mental health and well-being. If you feel that you need to take Thursday and Friday off to recharge and catch up on your work, that's perfectly understandable. Just make sure to communicate your plans with your teachers and make arrangements to catch up on any missed work. Remember that your health and well-being should always be a top priority.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=20, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 1509, 236789, 236751, 10649, 531, 1769, 506, 990, 1135, 600, 611, 1202, 531, 3213, 580, 822, 9069, 2404, 532, 1388, 236772, 16898, 236761, 1637, 611, 2597, 600, 611, 1202, 531, 1769, 9853, 532, 7672, 1135, 531, 50352, 532, 4682, 872, 580, 822, 981, 236764, 600, 236789, 236751, 13275, 57181, 236761, 5393, 1386, 2889, 531, 17730, 822, 6614, 607, 822, 10411, 532, 1386, 20573, 531, 4682, 872, 580, 1027, 15315, 981, 236761, 21429, 600, 822, 2404, 532, 1388, 236772, 16898, 1374, 2462, 577, 496, 1903, 13546, 236761], prompt_embeds shape: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
