INFO 09-15 16:08:40 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-ac97f79c2ba24b23bac52bce44bd158c-0: prompt: 'Create a TCP client in c# which connects to a machine on port 40957 on the ip 192.168.0.3. First it should read the welcome message of the server. Then the client needs to login with the message "LGIN x-stream". The response is either "Password correct" or "Password incorrect". If the password is correct send the message "GTMP?" and read the response which is a temperature. In the end send the message "LOGOUT" to the machine to close the connection gracefully.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=619, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 6924, 496, 51054, 4430, 528, 505, 236865, 837, 32407, 531, 496, 5464, 580, 2411, 236743, 236812, 236771, 236819, 236810, 236832, 580, 506, 11991, 236743, 236770, 236819, 236778, 236761, 236770, 236825, 236828, 236761, 236771, 236761, 236800, 236761, 5315, 625, 1374, 1676, 506, 8349, 3618, 529, 506, 5941, 236761, 4298, 506, 4430, 3548, 531, 14209, 607, 506, 3618, 623, 236798, 22509, 1123, 236772, 6678, 3056, 669, 3072, 563, 3477, 623, 12903, 4338, 236775, 653, 623, 12903, 21648, 3056, 1637, 506, 8918, 563, 4338, 5039, 506, 3618, 623, 22618, 5153, 7462, 532, 1676, 506, 3072, 837, 563, 496, 4022, 236761, 799, 506, 1345, 5039, 506, 3618, 623, 19998, 15429, 236775, 531, 506, 5464, 531, 3107, 506, 5603, 122605, 236761], prompt_embeds shape: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
