 36%|███▌      | 356/1000 [01:46<03:12,  3.34it/s]INFO 09-15 16:08:42 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-824703b0f85041769868e30de79c752e-0: prompt: 'def suggest\\_numbers(model):\n print("Getting last lottery winning numbers...")\n last\\_lotto\\_numbers = get\\_last\\_lotto\\_numbers()\n suggested\\_numbers = np.array([generate\\_lotto\\_numbers() for \\_ in range(5)])\n X\\_train = encode\\_data([generate\\_lotto\\_numbers() for \\_ in range(500)])\n y\\_train = np.zeros((500, 45))\n train\\_model(model, X\\_train, y\\_train)\n predictions = model.predict(suggested\\_numbers)\n predicted\\_numbers = []\n for pred in predictions:\n pred\\_number = decode\\_data(pred)\n predicted\\_numbers.append(pred\\_number)\n return predicted\\_numbers\n\ndef generate\\_suggestions():\n suggestions = []\n for \\_ in range(5):\n numbers = []\n for \\_ in range(6):\n number = np.random.randint(1, 46)\n while number in numbers:\n number = np.random.randint(1, 46)\n numbers.append(number)\n suggestions.append(sorted(numbers))\n return suggestions\n\ndef main():\n # Load the model\n model = load\\_model(\'lotto\\_model.h5\')\n \n # Get the last winning numbers\n last\\_numbers = get\\_last\\_numbers()\n \n # Generate the suggested numbers\n suggested\\_numbers = generate\\_suggestions()\n \n # Predict the bonus numbers for the suggested numbers\n bonus\\_predictions = predict\\_bonus\\_numbers(model, last\\_numbers, suggested\\_numbers)\n \n # Output the suggested numbers and their predicted bonus numbers\n for i, numbers in enumerate(suggested\\_numbers):\n print(f"Suggestion {i+1}: {numbers}, Bonus: {bonus\\_predictions[i]}")\n\n오류 수정이 안된 부분을 수정해줘\nAnswer in English.\n\nPlease write in English (US) language.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=26, min_toke