INFO 09-15 16:08:50 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-36e8a98e68484c33bee8bcd933403775-0: prompt: "Based on the provided synopsis and the previous outline, I have expanded the outline to include more details and incorporate the story's themes and elements.\n\nI. Act 1 - Setup\nA. Introduction\n\n1. Establish the setting: Tijuana, Mexico, 2060, post-Second Mexican-American War\n2. Introduce the protagonist: a disabled war veteran, raised by humble descendants of Aztec warriors\n3. Show the protagonist's life as a cashier and busboy in a seedy nightclub and love hotel\n\nB. Inciting Incident\n\n1. Protagonist meets an exotic dancer and comfort girl who connects him with a black-market broker\n2. The broker offers him cyborg legs and outdated quantum firmware in exchange for a favor\n\nC. Decision\n\n1. Protagonist accepts the offer and receives the new legs and firmware\n2. The favor: steal the latest quantum software's firmware and codebase for the broker's powerful client\n\nII. Act 2 - Confrontation\nA. Planning and Preparation\n\n1. Protagonist gathers information about the target\n2. Explores the underworld of cyborg black markets and narco transnational gangs\n\nB. Challenges and Obstacles\n\n1. Encounters with various adversaries, including corrupt government agents, corporate interests, and gangs\n2. Navigating the chaotic and ever-changing world of technology\n3. Overcoming the limitations of his outdated firmware and grappling with his new cyborg identity\n\nC. Midpoint\n\n1. Protagonist discovers a key piece of information about the powerful client's true intentions\n2. Stakes are raised: the power to control the new cyborg social order is at risk\n\nD. Complications and setbacks\n\n1. Unexpected betrayals or twists\n2. Protagonist's own moral identity is put to the test\n3. Consequences of actions taken earlier in the story\n\nIII. Act 3 - Resolution\nA. Climax\n\n1. Final confrontation with the powerful client and other adversaries\n2. Protagonist must make a choice between fulfilling his mission or protecting the greater good\n\nB. Resolution\n\n1. Outcome of the protagonist's decision: success or failure\n2. The fate of the quantum software and the cyborg social order\n\nC. Denouement\n\n1. Protagonist's personal journey and character arc\n2. The impact of the mission on the protagonist and the world\n3. Hints at the future of the characters and the chaotic world they inhabit\n\nNow that we have a more detailed outline based on the synopsis, please provide the list of principal characters and descriptions, and I'll be happy to help with further development.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=804, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 22515, 580, 506, 3847, 126325, 532, 506, 3527, 18161, 236764, 564, 735, 15744, 506, 18161, 531, 3204, 919, 4889, 532, 27968, 506, 3925, 236789, 236751, 22888, 532, 4820, 236761, 108, 236777, 236761, 3520, 236743, 236770, 753, 37827, 107, 236776, 236761, 23051, 108, 236770, 236761, 48741, 506, 6514, 236787, 156645, 236764, 13251, 236764, 236743, 236778, 236771, 236825, 236771, 236764, 1868, 236772, 12400, 26135, 236772, 14645, 5289, 107, 236778, 236761, 148683, 506, 61102, 236787, 496, 19477, 3653, 26896, 236764, 8675, 684, 36820, 53905, 529, 155312, 61505, 107, 236800, 236761, 8754, 506, 61102, 236789, 236751, 1972, 618, 496, 108786, 532, 1635, 19286, 528, 496, 636, 9000, 91174, 532, 2765, 8217, 108, 236799, 236761, 5295, 4143, 83647, 108, 236770, 236761, 49988, 219306, 20239, 614, 34457, 52904, 532, 5931, 3953, 1015, 32407, 1515, 607, 496, 2764, 236772, 16350, 28354, 107, 236778, 236761, 669, 2