 39%|███▉      | 392/1000 [01:55<01:27,  6.95it/s]INFO 09-15 16:08:51 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-5a456b9bb5904ba699e5b6f10361f2fb-0: prompt: "Career is an important aspect of our lives, and many of us strive to find fulfillment and success in our professional endeavors. Angel number 212 can hold unique and specific meanings in relation to our career paths. Here are ten unique and different practical phrases with practical advice on what angel number 212 means in relation to our careers:\n\n1. Follow Your Passion: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to follow your passion. You may be feeling unfulfilled or unsatisfied with your current job.\n\nPractical Advice: Take time to reflect on your passions and interests. Pursue opportunities that align with your values and bring you joy.\n\n1. Embrace Change: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to embrace change and be open to new opportunities. You may be feeling stuck in your current job or career path.\n\nPractical Advice: Be open to new experiences and opportunities. Network with others in your industry and seek out mentors for guidance.\n\n1. Trust Your Intuition: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to trust your intuition. You may be feeling unsure about a career decision or direction.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice mindfulness and listen to your inner voice. Trust in the universe and have faith that everything is happening for your highest good.\n\n1. Take Initiative: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to take initiative and be proactive in pursuing your goals. You may be waiting for opportunities to come to you.\n\nPractical Advice: Take action towards your goals and be proactive in your career. Seek out opportunities for growth and development.\n\n1. Practice Persistence: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to practice persistence and perseverance in pursuing your goals. You may be facing challenges or setbacks.\n\nPractical Advice: Stay focused on your goals and practice resilience in the face of challenges. Seek support from colleagues or mentors for guidance.\n\n1. Prioritize Self-Improvement: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to prioritize self-improvement and growth in your professional life. You may be feeling stagnant or unchallenged in your current job.\n\nPractical Advice: Take courses or workshops to improve your skills and knowledge. Seek feedback from colleagues or mentors to identify areas for growth.\n\n1. Embrace Leadership: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to embrace leadership and take on new responsibilities. You may be ready for a promotion or new leadership role.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice confidence and take on new challenges. Seek out leadership opportunities and show your ability to lead and inspire others.\n\n1. Practice Time Management: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to practice time management and prioritize your tasks and responsibilities. You may be feeling overwhelmed or disorganized.\n\nPractical Advice: Create a schedule or to-do list to manage your time effectively. Prioritize your tasks and delegate when necessary.\n\n1. Cultivate Positive Relationships: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to cultivate positive relationships with colleagues and coworkers. You may be experiencing conflict or tension in your workplace.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice active listening and communicate openly with your colleagues. Show mutual respect and celebrate each other's strengths.\n\n1. Prioritize Work-Life Balance: Seeing 212 in relation to your career is a message to prioritize work-life balance. You may be feeling burnt out or overwhelmed.\n\nPractical Advice: Set boundaries between work and personal life. Prioritize self-care and take time for yourself outside of work.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0,