INFO 09-15 16:08:52 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-af6b8af2dc734881bb3dc22f83d34cf1-0: prompt: 'RenPy is a powerful visual novel engine that offers a wide range of features to bring your story to life. Here are a few obscure ones that you might find useful:\n\n1. Transitions: RenPy allows you to create smooth transitions between different parts of your story. You can use the `transition` command to specify how the screen should change between two different images. For example:\n```\n    show bg old with dissolve\n    transition fade\n    show bg new\n```\nIn this example, the `dissolve` transition is used to smoothly transition from the "old" background image to the "new" background image.\n\n2. Dynamic text: You can use the `python` command to insert dynamic text into your story. For example, you can use a variable to store the player\'s name and then use that variable in your dialogue.\n```\n    $ player_name = "John"\n    "Hello, [python $player_name]"\n```\nIn this example, the variable `player_name` is set to "John" and then used in the dialogue to personalize the greeting.\n\n3. Conditional statements: RenPy allows you to use conditional statements to change the flow of your story depending on the choices the player makes. For example:\n```\n    if variable = "good":\n        "You have chosen the good path."\n    elif variable = "neutral":\n        "You have chosen the neutral path."\n    else:\n        "You have chosen the evil path."\n```\nIn this example, the script checks the value of the variable and then displays different dialogue depending on the value.\n\n4. Sound and music: RenPy allows you to play sound effects and music in your visual novel. For example:\n```\n    play music "bgm.ogg"\n    play sound "explosion.ogg"\n```\nIn this example, the script plays background music "bgm.ogg" and a sound effect "explosion.ogg"\n\n5. Animation: RenPy allows you to animate images and sprites in your visual novel. For example:\n```\n    image bg = "bg.png"\n```', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=36, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 34630, 16251, 563, 496, 8632, 7426, 10132, 3958, 600, 5469, 496, 5777, 2644, 529, 4065, 531, 3437, 822, 3925, 531, 1972, 236761, 5715, 659, 496, 2321, 47834, 5906, 600, 611, 2473, 1586, 6684, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 161073, 236787, 13725, 16251, 5862, 611, 531, 2619, 7080, 25477, 1534, 1607, 4688, 529, 822, 3925, 236761, 1599, 740, 1161, 506, 2165, 24639, 236929, 4991, 531, 20193, 1217, 506, 4322, 1374, 2352, 1534, 1156, 1607, 4876, 236761, 1701, 2591, 236787, 107, 2717, 107, 140, 4919, 17082, 2255, 607, 56490, 107, 140, 24639, 29625, 107, 140, 4919, 17082, 861, 107, 2717, 107, 902, 672, 2591, 236764, 506, 2165, 102642, 152229, 236929, 7140, 563, 1456, 531, 35495, 7140, 699, 506, 623, 947, 236775, 1695, 2471, 531, 506, 623, 1951, 236775, 1695, 2471, 236761, 108, 236778, 236761, 39332, 1816, 236787, 1599, 740, 1161, 506, 2165, 6719, 236929, 4991, 531, 7934, 10795, 1816, 1131, 822, 3925, 236761, 1701, 2591, 236764, 611, 740, 1161, 496, 6471, 531, 4762, 506, 4155, 236789, 236751, 1463, 532, 1299, 1161, 600, 6471, 528, 822, 22986, 236761, 107, 2717, 107, 140, 236795, 4155, 236779, 1201, 578, 623, 12720, 236775, 107, 140, 236775, 9259, 236764, 870, 6719, 609, 5000, 236779, 1201, 50190, 107, 2717, 107, 902, 672, 2591, 236764, 506, 6471, 2165, 5000, 236779, 1201, 236929, 563, 1076, 531, 623, 12720, 236775, 532, 1299, 1456, 528, 506, 22986, 531, 96453, 506, 26227, 236761, 108, 236800, 236761, 140007, 11461, 236787, 13725, 16251, 5862, 611, 531, 1161, 32622, 11461, 531, 2352, 506, 2727, 529, 822, 3925,