INFO 09-15 16:09:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-ffb10655fa03446e96d67a848e4efe1f-0: prompt: "Here is the updated codebase structure with the added Redux store:\n```lua\n├── components/\n│   ├── MyComponent/\n│   │   ├── index.tsx\n│   │   └── styles.module.css\n│   └── ...\n├── pages/\n│   ├── index.tsx\n│   └── ...\n├── public/\n│   ├── images/\n│   └── ...\n├── store/\n│   ├── actions/\n│   │   ├── actionTypes.ts\n│   │   ├── index.ts\n│   │   └── data.ts\n│   ├── reducers/\n│   │   ├── index.ts\n│   │   └── data.ts\n│   ├── types.ts\n│   ├── store.ts\n│   └── utils.ts\n├── styles/\n│   ├── globals.css\n│   └── tailwind.css\n├── utils/\n│   ├── api.ts\n│   └── myUtility.ts\n├── .eslintrc.json\n├── .gitignore\n├── next-env.d.ts\n├── next.config.js\n├── package.json\n├── postcss.config.js\n├── tailwind.config.js\n├── tsconfig.json\n└── yarn.lock\n```\nHere's a brief explanation of the updated files/folders:\n\n* `store/actions/`: Contains all Redux action files. The `data.ts` file contains the `setData` action.\n* `store/reducers/`: Contains all Redux reducer files. The `data.ts` file contains the `dataReducer` function.\n* `store/types.ts`: Contains the `AppState` type used in the Redux store.\n* `store/store.ts`: Contains the Redux store configuration.\n* `store/utils.ts`: Contains the `mapDispatchToProps` function used to dispatch actions.\n* `utils/api.ts`: Updated to dispatch the `setData` action with the API response.\n* `pages/index.tsx`: Updated to use the Redux store and dispatch the `setData` action.\n\nNote that the `globals.css`, `tailwind.css`, `next.config.js`, `postcss.config.js`, and `tailwind.config.js` files are the same as in the previous version of the codebase.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=13, min_tokens=0,