 48%|████▊     | 480/1000 [02:19<01:48,  4.81it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:15 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-91cc337f72f5449ea898fb4d897a481a-0: prompt: 'Sure, you can use an arrow icon instead of the cross icon for the collapsable tree. Here\'s an example of how you can use FontAwesome\'s arrow icon for the parent nodes:\n```\n<div class="parent-node">\n    <i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i> Parent 1\n    <div class="child-node">Child 1</div>\n    <div class="child-node">Child 2</div>\n</div>\n```\nYou can use the `fa-arrow-down` class to show the arrow pointing down and the `fa-arrow-up` class to show the arrow pointing up.\n\nHere\'s the JavaScript code to toggle the arrow\'s direction when the parent node is clicked:\n```\n<script>\n$(document).ready(function() {\n  $(\'.parent-node\').click(function() {\n    $(this).nextUntil(\'.parent-node\').\n```', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=6, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 49190, 236764, 611, 740, 1161, 614, 14290, 4822, 5205, 529, 506, 4071, 4822, 573, 506, 3995, 2786, 742, 5028, 236761, 5715, 236789, 236751, 614, 2591, 529, 1217, 611, 740, 1161, 17548, 71229, 236789, 236751, 14290, 4822, 573, 506, 3724, 13653, 236787, 107, 2717, 107, 236820, 1928, 1012, 718, 5432, 236772, 5335, 905, 107, 140, 236820, 236747, 1012, 718, 22712, 2854, 236772, 2681, 236772, 3843, 905, 210, 25401, 236743, 236770, 107, 140, 236820, 1928, 1012, 718, 10869, 236772, 5335, 905, 9178, 236743, 236770, 235, 107, 140, 236820, 1928, 1012, 718, 10869, 236772, 5335, 905, 9178, 236743, 236778, 235, 107, 235, 107, 2717, 107, 3048, 740, 1161, 506, 2165, 5742, 2