 51%|█████     | 508/1000 [02:26<02:22,  3.46it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:22 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-b21dc20af72d46bd99af6975bf6c3a08-0: prompt: "Sure, here's an example conversation between a product manager (PM) and a business executive (BE) where 50 terms are highlighted in bold:\n\n**PM**: Good morning, **BE**! I wanted to give you an update on the progress of our new feature rollout.\n\n**BE**: Great, **PM**! What's the latest **status**?\n\n**PM**: We've completed the **user research** phase and have gathered a lot of valuable **customer feedback**. We're now in the **product design** phase, where we're **brainstorming** and **prioritizing** features based on what we've learned from our research.\n\n**BE**: That sounds good, **PM**. How are you **managing** the project timeline?\n\n**PM**: We're using **agile** methodology, so we have **sprints** and **backlogs** to keep us on track. Our **product roadmap** outlines the **milestones** we need to hit to stay on schedule.\n\n**BE**: And how are you **testing** the new features?\n\n**PM**: We have a dedicated **quality assurance** team that's conducting **user acceptance testing** (UAT) to make sure everything works as expected. We're also doing **A/B testing** to see which features are resonating with users.\n\n**BE**: Excellent, **PM**. How are you **measuring** the success of the feature rollout?\n\n**PM**: We're using a variety of **key performance indicators** (KPIs) to measure things like **user engagement**, **conversion rates**, and **customer satisfaction**. We're also doing **analytics** on the backend to track how the features are impacting our **revenue** and **profit margins**.\n\n**BE**: That's all great to hear, **PM**. Keep up the good work!", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, ma