 51%|█████▏    | 514/1000 [02:27<01:18,  6.18it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:23 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-b7379095db9147fd8b3444404a5ca130-0: prompt: 'Metaphors and Analogies:\nMetaphors and analogies are powerful tools that can be used to build awareness and understanding of complex healthcare concepts. By using comparisons and analogies, healthcare providers can help patients and their families to better understand their condition, treatment options, and care plan.\n\nMetaphors can be particularly effective in helping patients to visualize and understand their condition. For example, a healthcare provider might use the metaphor of a "traffic jam" to explain how a blockage in the arteries can lead to a heart attack. This comparison can help patients to better understand the cause of their condition and how it can be treated.\n\nAnalogies can also be effective in building awareness and understanding of complex healthcare concepts. For example, a healthcare provider might use the analogy of a "remote control" to explain how medication works in the body. Just as a remote control can be used to turn a television on and off or adjust the volume, medication can be used to turn certain receptors on and off in the body to achieve a desired effect.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=225, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 11921, 670, 8002, 532, 76268, 695, 236787, 107, 11921, 670, 8002, 532, 186193, 659, 8632, 6436, 600, 740, 577, 1456, 531, 2016, 14496, 532, 6611, 529, 3996, 16106, 14485, 236761, 3763, 1699, 33772, 532, 186193, 236764, 16106, 15063, 740, 1601, 4399, 532, 910, 7965, 