 67%|██████▋   | 670/1000 [03:11<02:22,  2.32it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:07 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-f516dd6847a143fd89af0e61cffba436-0: prompt: 'Certainly. Here is the text for the conclusion section of the white paper:\n\n---\n\nConclusion\n\nIn summary, Eco is a decentralized autonomous organization (DAO) that aims to revolutionize the carbon offset market through the use of blockchain technology and machine learning. By creating a traceability application that utilizes precision forestry AI and advanced aerial data analytics, Eco is able to provide precise digital forest management information and enable the creation of forward carbon reference tokens. These tokens can be used to pay for carbon offset projects, such as planting trees, and provide a verifiable and transparent method for offsetting carbon emissions.\n\nThe Eco DAO also includes a governance structure in which all participants, including land owners, forest engineers, carbon offset buyers, and solidity coders, can collaborate and make decisions through the use of smart contracts. This ensures that the Eco ecosystem is fully decentralized and self-sustaining.\n\nOverall, Eco represents a significant advancement in the carbon offset market, providing a superior and scalable solution that utilizes open source code, machine learning, and token economics to create a truly decentralized and autonomous carbon offset registry.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=15, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 117494, 236761, 5715, 563, 506, 1816, 573, 506, 12882, 3336, 529, 506, 2173, 3627, 236787, 108, 7243, 108, 30792,