 70%|███████   | 704/1000 [03:20<01:12,  4.06it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:16 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-66ab7a4a093046e6af76b3c008f28aa4-0: prompt: 'As the founder of Project LIV, our product is an e-commerce marketplace that focuses on supporting small businesses and promoting locally-made and unique products to customers. Our solution addresses the problem of mainstream marketplaces that often prioritize large-scale, well-known brands and make it difficult for customers to discover authentic, locally-made products. We aim to create a platform where small businesses can easily sell their products to a wider audience and customers can discover unique items that match their preferences.\n\nFor example, a small artisanal clothing brand from a remote part of India may not have the resources to market their products on mainstream e-commerce platforms. However, with Project LIV, they can easily upload their products, reach a wider audience, and build a following of customers who value authentic, locally-made products.\n\nOur value to customers lies in the ability to provide a platform where they can discover unique, authentic, and quality products that they may not have access to on conventional marketplaces. Customers can easily find and purchase items that match their specific needs and preferences, and support small businesses in the process.\n\nOur unique selling point is the focus on supporting small businesses and promoting locally-made and unique products to customers. We believe that this approach will differentiate us from other e-commerce platforms and help us build a loyal customer base that values authenticity and quality.\n\nAt the moment, we are in the ideation and validation stage, gathering feedback from potential customers and small business owners to refine our platform and create a product that best serves their needs.\n\nWe do not have any patents or IP at the moment, as our focus is on creating a platform that supports small businesses and connects them with customers.\n\nBelow is a flowchart that outlines the basic functionality of our platform:\n\n[Insert Flowchart Image]', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=7, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2205, 506, 20629, 529, 7879, 152412, 236764, 1023, 1698, 563, 614, 545, 236772, 25351, 34108, 600, 21132, 580, 11584, 1944, 8634, 532, 20329, 16445, 236772, 12901, 532, 4709, 3211, 531, 5103, 236761, 5137, 3465, 19246, 506, 2608, 529, 31653, 156251, 600, 3187, 56856, 2455, 236772, 7669, 236764, 1388, 236772, 5863, 13965, 532, 1386, 625, 3909, 573, 5103, 531, 6878, 24636, 236764, 16445, 236772, 12901, 3211, 236761, 1191, 6342, 531, 2619, 496, 5058, 1298, 1944, 8634, 740, 5583, 6739, 910, 3211, 531, 496, 17865, 9998, 532, 5103, 740, 6878, 4709, 4852, 600, 4241, 910, 22195, 236761, 108, 2542, 2591, 236764, 496, 1944, 141474, 15337, 5500, 699, 496, 10883, 912, 529, 4673, 1149, 711, 735, 506, 5405, 531, 2436, 910, 3211, 580, 31653, 545, 236772, 25351, 14175, 236761, 3153, 236764, 607, 7879, 152412, 236764, 901, 740, 5583, 13612, 910, 3211, 236764, 5370, 496, 17865, 9998, 236764, 532, 2016, 496, 2269, 529, 5103, 1015, 1550, 24636, 236764, 16445, 236772, 12901, 3211, 236761, 108, 7711, 1550, 531, 5103, 12828, 528, 506, 5596, 531, 2847, 496, 5058, 1298, 901, 740, 6878, 4709, 236764, 24636, 236764, 532, 3325, 3211, 600, 901, 1149, 711, 735, 2802, 531, 580, 15473, 156251, 236761, 39689, 740, 5583, 1586, 532, 7408, 4852, 600, 4241, 910, 3530, 3548, 532, 22195, 236764, 532, 1894, 1944, 8634, 528, 506, 1657, 236761, 108, 7711, 4709, 11010, 1523, 563, 506, 3213, 580, 11584, 1944, 8634, 532, 