 72%|███████▏  | 717/1000 [03:23<01:17,  3.64it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:19 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-f873442839b1423a8eb3869ef5c3162d-0: prompt: 'Here are the steps you can follow when creating a pillar page:\n\n1. Choose a broad topic: Select a topic that is relevant to your business and can cover multiple subtopics. The topic should be broad enough to be broken down into subtopics but narrow enough to stay focused on a specific area.\n2. Identify subtopics: Identify subtopics related to your broad topic and create a list. These subtopics should cover all aspects of the broad topic, and each subtopic should be able to stand on its own as a blog post.\n3. Create a structure: Organize the subtopics in a logical order, creating a structure for your pillar page. You may choose to start with an introduction and overview of the broad topic, followed by the subtopics in a logical order, ending with a conclusion.\n4. Write high-quality content: Create high-quality content for each subtopic. Ensure that each section is informative, engaging, and provides value to the reader. Use images, infographics, and other media to enhance the content.\n5. Optimize the content: Optimize your content for search engines by using relevant keywords, meta descriptions, and optimizing images. This will help your pillar page rank higher in search engine results pages (SERPs).\n6. Link to relevant content: Link to relevant blog posts, articles, or other resources within your website. This will provide additional information to the reader and keep them engaged with your website.\n7. Promote your pillar page: Promote your pillar page on social media, email newsletters, and other marketing channels. This will help drive traffic to your website and increase engagement with your content.\n8. Update your pillar page: Update your pillar page periodically with new content, statistics, and other relevant information. This will keep your pillar page relevant and fresh, providing ongoing value to your readers.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=184, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 8291, 659, 506, 6555, 611, 740, 1500, 1056, 7107, 496, 63475, 3104, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 23399, 496, 6674, 10562, 236787, 13466, 496, 10562, 600, 563, 7798, 531, 822, 1960, 532, 740, 2890, 5065, 1159, 51996, 236761, 669, 10562, 1374, 577, 6674, 3487, 531, 577, 11207, 1679, 1131, 1159, 51996, 840, 12019, 3487, 531, 4196, 10317, 580, 496, 3530, 2433, 236761, 107, 236778, 236761, 49644, 1159, 51996, 236787, 49644, 1159, 51996, 4596, 531, 822, 6674, 10562, 532, 2619, 496, 1694, 236761, 3143, 1159, 51996, 1374, 2890, 784, 10217, 529, 506, 6674, 10562, 236764, 532, 1546, 1159, 29449, 1374, 577, 2735, 531, 1975, 580, 1061, 1852, 618, 496, 7200, 1868, 236761, 107, 236800, 236761, 8600, 496, 3904, 236787, 173856, 506, 1159, 51996, 528, 496, 23420, 1900, 236764, 7107, 496, 3904, 573, 822, 63475, 3104, 236761, 1599, 1149, 5347, 531, 1502, 607, 614, 12650, 532, 21385, 529, 506, 6674, 10562, 236764, 6641, 684, 506, 1159, 51996, 528, 496, 23420, 1900, 236764, 16548, 607, 496, 12882, 236761, 107, 236812, 236761, 15642, 1494, 236772, 15276, 3004, 236787, 8600, 1494, 236772, 15276, 3004, 573, 1546, 1159, 29449, 236761, 41152, 600, 1546, 3336, 563, 40564, 236764, 21964, 236764, 532, 4728, 1550, 531, 506, 11863, 236761, 6890, 4876, 236764, 176674, 236764, 532, 1032, 4009, 531, 14051, 506, 3004, 236761, 107, 236810, 236761, 136381, 506, 3004, 236787, 136381, 822, 3004, 573, 3927, 18362, 684, 1699, 7798, 30154, 236764, 18102, 29141, 236764, 532, 61232, 4876, 236761, 1174, 795, 1601, 822, 63475, 3104, 834