INFO 09-15 16:10:27 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-ea6395870f584678b4516130af0e3587-0: prompt: 'Sure! Here are some general UI text writing guidelines and rules to keep in mind:\n\n1. Use Clear and Concise Language: UI text should be written using clear and concise language that is easy for users to understand. Avoid using technical jargon or overly complex terms that may confuse or frustrate users.\n2. Be Action-Oriented: UI text should be action-oriented, prompting users to take specific actions or providing guidance on how to proceed. Use active verbs and avoid using passive voice or ambiguous language.\n3. Be Consistent: Consistency is key in UI writing to ensure that the language used is clear and familiar to users. Use consistent terminology and formatting throughout the interface, and follow established conventions for labels and buttons.\n4. Consider the Context: UI text should be written with the context in mind. Consider where the text will appear and what the user is trying to accomplish. Use language that is relevant to the user and the task at hand.\n5. Provide Feedback: UI text should provide feedback to the user, letting them know that their action has been completed or that there is an error that needs to be fixed. Use language that is clear and provides guidance on how to proceed.\n6. Use Visual Cues: Use visual cues, such as icons and images, to help users understand the purpose and function of UI elements. Use these cues consistently throughout the interface to provide a clear and intuitive user experience.\n7. Prioritize Information: Prioritize the most important information in UI text, placing it in a prominent location or using bold text to make it stand out. Use progressive disclosure to reveal additional information as needed.\n8. Use Proper Grammar and Spelling: UI text should be written using proper grammar and spelling to ensure that it is clear and professional. Use a spellchecker and proofread your text carefully to avoid errors.\n\nBy following these guidelines and rules, you can create effective and user-friendly UI text that enhances the user experience and helps users to navigate the interface more easily.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=22, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 49190, 236888, 5715, 659, 1070, 2870, 9711, 1816, 5712, 15700, 532, 6366, 531, 2514, 528, 3666, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 6890, 25179, 532, 229101, 22160, 236787, 9711, 1816, 1374, 577, 5267, 1699, 3582, 532, 63510, 5192, 600, 563, 3735, 573, 5089, 531, 3050, 236761, 39874, 1699, 8330, 127481, 653, 50708, 3996, 3755, 600, 1149, 71635, 653, 201500, 5089, 236761, 107, 236778, 236761, 2199, 10659, 236772, 38327, 524, 236787, 9711, 1816, 1374, 577, 2970, 236772, 29963, 236764, 80121, 5089, 531, 1769, 3530, 7419, 653, 6655, 14984, 580, 1217, 531, 7162, 236761, 6890, 5158, 84364, 532, 5571, 1699, 30461, 8300, 653, 64426, 5192, 236761, 107, 236800, 236761, 2199, 108135, 236787, 194387, 563, 2307, 528, 9711, 5712, 531, 5330, 600, 506, 5192, 1456, 563, 3582, 532, 10334, 531, 5089, 236761, 6890, 9958, 36010, 532, 53892, 5459, 506, 7937, 236764, 532, 1500, 6697, 53359, 573, 12972, 532, 16893, 236761, 107, 236812, 236761, 14066, 506, 17605, 236787, 9711, 1816, 1374, 577, 5267, 607, 506, 4403, 528, 3666, 236761, 14066, 1298, 506, 1816, 795, 3196, 532, 1144, 506, 2430, 563, 4875, 531, 21479, 236761, 6890, 5192, 600, 563, 7798, 531, 506, 2430, 532, 506, 4209, 657, 1526, 236761, 107, 236810, 236761, 39525, 51474, 236787, 9711, 1816, 1374, 2847, 9697, 531, 506, 2430, 236764, 23725, 1091, 1281, 600, 910, 2970, 815, 1010, 7723, 653, 600, 99