 76%|███████▌  | 762/1000 [03:32<00:33,  7.15it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:28 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-870bf0abd70b47e9832ae3a601a37946-0: prompt: "I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to Suncor's journey towards becoming a data-informed enterprise, and to help drive adoption of enterprise data and dashboards within the business. As someone who values collaboration and continuous improvement, I appreciate the emphasis on building informal teams and driving change.\n\nIn addition to Suncor's focus on low-carbon operations, safety, and diversity, I was also impressed by the company's recent initiatives to increase efficiency and reduce costs in its operations. I read about Suncor's implementation of new technologies, such as artificial intelligence and predictive analytics, to optimize its operations and improve its bottom line.\n\nI believe that my skills and experience in data analysis and visualization can contribute to these efforts, by helping to identify areas for improvement and develop actionable insights that can drive efficiency and cost savings. I look forward to the opportunity to work with Suncor's talented professionals and contribute to the company's continued success in the industry.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=40, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 236777, 1006, 9775, 1003, 506, 5506, 531, 13157, 531, 555, 4094, 504, 236789, 236751, 9338, 5645, 10425, 496, 1262, 236772, 78479, 18315, 236764, 532, 531, 1601, 5697, 22109, 529, 18315, 1262, 532, 148407, 2351, 506, 1960, 236761, 1773, 5026, 1015, 2979, 13859, 532, 8906, 11531, 236764, 564, 147