INFO 09-15 16:10:34 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-6db887ce1fe34513bfdc636fce2859ab-0: prompt: "Sure, here's an example of how the interface for a mobile app with a map view, nearby agents and priority access based on distance could look like:\n```markdown\n ____________________________________________________________________\n|                                                                    |\n|                        MY EMERGENCY APP                             |\n|____________________________________________________________________|\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  MAP  |  SEARCH   |    NOTIFICATIONS    |   PROFILE    |    HELP     |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|                   NEARBY AGENTS & SERVICES                          |\n|                                                                     |\n|            POLICE             |           AMBULANCE                  |\n|                                                                     |\n|         - 0.3 km -            |        - 0.7 km -                    |\n|                                                                     |\n|        John Doe, 2467        |     St. Mary's Hospital, 865          |\n|        Jane Smith, 1594      |     ABC Ambulance Service, 562        |\n|                                                                     |\n|          FIRE DEPT.          |         ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE           |\n|                                                                     |\n|         - 1.2 km -           |          - 2.1 km -                   |\n|                                                                     |\n|     Station 34, 1631         |     ABC Towing, 1079                  |\n|     Station 18, 2647         |     AAA Roadside Assistance, 2093     |\n|_____________________________________________________________________|\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|                        PRIORITY ACCESS                               |\n|                                                                       |\n| 1. John Doe - Police - 0.3 km                                         |\n|                                                                       |\n| 2. Jane Smith - Police - 0.5 km                                        |\n|                                                                       |\n| 3. St. Mary's Hospital - Ambulance - 0.7 km                            |\n|                                                                       |\n| 4. Station 34 - Fire Dept. - 1.2 km                                   |\n|                                                                       |\n| 5. ABC Ambulance Service - Ambulance - 1.6 km                          |\n|_______________________________________________________________________|\n```\nThis app would allow users to quickly access emergency services based on their location, with priority given to nearby agents and services. The interface includes a map view, search function, notification center, profile settings and help section. Users can view the nearest police officers, ambulances, fire departments and roadside assistance services on the map, along with their distance and contact information. Additionally, the priority access section shows the top agents and services based on their distance from the user.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=10, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token