 88%|████████▊ | 876/1000 [03:56<00:30,  4.05it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:52 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-26c4ec0b1df74d2da7a3e32506ad7464-0: prompt: 'To install `curl` on HP-UX, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Download the `curl` binary package for HP-UX from a trusted source. One such source is the HP-UX Porting and Archive Centre (<https://hpux.connect.org.uk/>).\n2. Extract the contents of the package file using the `swinstall` command. For example:\n```lua\nswinstall -s /path/to/package/file -x autoreboot=true\n```\nThis command installs the `curl` package and sets the `autoreboot` option to true, which will automatically reboot the system if necessary.\n\n1. Verify that `curl` is installed by running the following command:\n```css\ncurl --version\n```\nThis command should display the version number of `curl` if it is installed correctly.\n\nNote that if you are installing `curl` on an older version of HP-UX, you may need to install additional dependencies or libraries to ensure that `curl` runs correctly. You can consult the documentation for your version of HP-UX to determine if any additional steps are required.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=91, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2021, 4476, 2165, 40192, 236929, 580, 20761, 236772, 31333, 236764, 611, 740, 1500, 1239, 6555, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 15993, 506, 2165, 40192, 236929, 14820, 8289, 573, 20761, 236772, 31333, 699, 496, 26576, 3738, 236761, 3656, 1288, 3738, 563, 506, 20761, 236772, 31333, 5348, 522, 532, 40187, 11368, 44229, 2574, 1411, 24210, 1939, 236761, 6280, 236761, 2187, 236761, 1490, 5336,