 91%|█████████ | 906/1000 [04:02<00:15,  6.04it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:58 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-34717fcd60d5498083c02aa12b154e6a-0: prompt: "Sure, here's a table version of the schedule:\n\n| Time | Task |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1:00-2:00 PM | Meal Planning and Grocery List |\n|  | - Take inventory of ingredients |\n|  | - Decide on meals for the week |\n|  | - Make a grocery list for items to buy |\n|  | - If possible, order groceries online or schedule a pick-up for later today |\n| 2:00-2:30 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Relax and recharge before getting started on cleaning |\n| 2:30-3:30 PM | Clean Out the Fridge and Freezer |\n|  | - Take everything out and sort into categories |\n|  | - Check expiration dates and throw away expired or no longer good items |\n|  | - Wipe down shelves and drawers with soap and water |\n| 3:30-4:00 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Have a snack or do something enjoyable |\n| 4:00-5:00 PM | Clean Out the Pantry |\n|  | - Take everything out and sort into categories |\n|  | - Check expiration dates and throw away expired or no longer good items |\n|  | - Wipe down shelves and replace items in an organized manner |\n| 5:00-5:30 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Relax and recharge before moving on to the next task |\n| 5:30-6:30 PM | Clean the Living Room |\n|  | - Dust and vacuum furniture and floors |\n|  | - Wipe down surfaces with a damp cloth |\n|  | - Organize any clutter or mess |\n| 6:30-7:00 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Have dinner or a snack to refuel |\n| 7:00-8:00 PM | Clean the Kitchen |\n|  | - Clean the counters, sink, and stove |\n|  | - Wipe down the refrigerator, dishwasher, and cabinets |\n|  | - Sweep and mop the floors |\n| 8:00-8:30 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Relax and recharge before the final task |\n| 8:30-9:30 PM | Clean the Bathroom |\n|  | - Clean the sink, toilet, shower, and bathtub |\n|  | - Wipe down surfaces with a damp cloth |\n|  | - Sweep and mop the floors |\n| 9:30-10:00 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Congr