oud Network Engineer | Virtual Private Cloud (VPC), Cloud Load Balancing, Cloud DNS | Privileged (Admin) | Design and maintain cloud networks | Designing and implementing cloud networks using VPC, Load Balancing, and DNS |\n| Security Engineer | Security Analyst | Cloud Security Command Center, Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM), Cloud KMS | Privileged (Security Admin) | Identify and remediate security threats | Analyzing security logs and alerts, managing access control using IAM, and managing encryption keys using KMS |\n| Security Engineer | Compliance Analyst | Cloud Security Command Center, Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM), Cloud KMS | Standard (Viewer) | Ensure compliance with security standards and regulations | Monitoring compliance using Cloud Security Command Center, managing access control using IAM, and managing encryption keys using KMS |\n| Business Decision Maker | Executive | BigQuery, Data Studio, Dataflow | Standard (Viewer) | Make data-driven business decisions | Analyzing business data using BigQuery, creating reports and dashboards using Data Studio, and monitoring data pipelines using Dataflow |\n| Tech Support | Support Engineer | Stackdriver, Cloud Trace, Cloud Debugger | Standard (Editor) | Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues | Debugging applications and infrastructure using Stackdriver, Cloud Trace, and Cloud Debugger |\n| Support Account Viewer | Support Account Viewer | Google Cloud Console, Cloud Billing API | Standard (Viewer) | View and manage billing information for support cases | Viewing and managing billing information for support cases using the Google Cloud Console and the Cloud Billing API |\n| Management | Manager | Google Cloud Console, Cloud Billing, Cloud Storage, Cloud IAM | Standard (Editor) | Manage cloud resources and budgets | Managing cloud resources and budgets using the Google Cloud Console, Cloud Billing, Cloud Storage, and Cloud IAM |\n| Machine Learning Analyst | Machine Learning Engineer |