 94%|█████████▍| 944/1000 [04:07<00:07,  7.51it/s]INFO 09-15 16:11:04 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-ac49fe27c0534ee4b1fbbb3de35d78f5-0: prompt: "The repeated mention of Mary treasuring or pondering the events surrounding Jesus' birth and childhood in her heart is significant for a few reasons. Firstly, it emphasizes Mary's role as a faithful disciple of Jesus, who sought to understand and reflect on the significance of his life and mission. Mary's actions demonstrate a willingness to learn from and meditate on the teachings and actions of Jesus, and serve as an example for other believers to follow.\n\nSecondly, the mention of Mary treasuring these things in her heart also highlights the unique nature of Jesus' identity and mission. Luke's Gospel presents Jesus as the long-awaited Messiah, who came to save his people from sin and reconcile them to God. The events surrounding his birth, such as the angelic announcement to the shepherds, the prophetic declarations of Simeon and Anna, and the visit of the Magi, all point to Jesus' divine origin and purpose. Mary's reflection on these events further underscores their importance and helps to establish Jesus' identity as the Son of God.\n\nFinally, the mention of Mary treasuring these things in her heart also serves to contrast her response with that of the other characters in the Gospel who do not understand or accept Jesus' message. Throughout the Gospel of Luke, Jesus encounters various individuals who struggle to comprehend or reject his teachings, such as the religious leaders who oppose him or the disciples who fail to grasp the significance of his mission. Mary's faithful reflection on the events surrounding Jesus' life stands in contrast to these other characters and serves as a model for how believers can respond to and grow in their understanding of God's word.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=27, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 818, 12457, 4928, 529, 8712, 25604, 1415, 653, 151538, 506, 4749, 12989, 9699, 236789, 6681, 532, 18918, 528, 1116, 3710, 563, 3629, 573, 496, 2321, 7483, 236761, 61911, 236764, 625, 58811, 8712, 236789, 236751, 3853, 618, 496, 35004, 93101, 529, 9699, 236764, 1015, 15023, 531, 3050, 532, 7495, 580, 506, 17141, 529, 914, 1972, 532, 9017, 236761, 8712, 236789, 236751, 7419, 15128, 496, 42637, 531, 3449, 699, 532, 125377, 580, 506, 57996, 532, 7419, 529, 9699, 236764, 532, 7298, 618, 614, 2591, 573, 1032, 68944, 531, 1500, 236761, 108, 96911, 236764, 506, 4928, 529, 8712, 25604, 1415, 1239, 2432, 528, 1116, 3710, 992, 20756, 506, 4709, 4135, 529, 9699, 236789, 9834, 532, 9017, 236761, 29045, 236789, 236751, 47450, 15060, 9699, 618, 506, 1440, 236772, 113338, 96051, 236764, 1015, 3588, 531, 5383, 914, 1331, 699, 4343, 532, 81715, 1091, 531, 3803, 236761, 669, 4749, 12989, 914, 6681, 236764, 1288, 618, 506, 205765, 20394, 531, 506, 192278, 236764, 506, 99453, 49432, 529, 178151, 532, 24944, 236764, 532, 506, 3517, 529, 506, 208294, 236764, 784, 1523, 531, 9699, 236789, 29432, 9059, 532, 5708, 236761, 8712, 236789, 236751, 16856, 580, 1239, 4749, 3342, 104811, 910, 8020, 532, 7351, 531, 6869, 9699, 236789, 9834, 618, 506, 10333, 529, 3803, 236761, 108, 18664, 236764, 506, 4928, 529, 8712, 25604, 1415, 1239, 2432, 528, 1116, 3710, 992, 14736, 531, 9530, 1116, 3072, 607, 600, 529, 506, 1032, 7579, 528, 506, 47450, 1015, 776, 711, 3050, 653, 4242, 9699, 236789, 3618, 236761, 43725, 506, 47450, 529, 29045, 236764, 9699, 50004, 3572, 7010, 1015, 16438, 531, 54653, 653, 11450, 914, 57996, 236764, 1288, 618, 506, 12352, 5670, 1015, 51373, 1515, 653, 506, 4852