 12%|█▏        | 117/1000 [00:15<02:48,  5.25it/s]INFO 09-15 16:12:23 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-9e31861d87434711a150d358ec589ec7-0: prompt: "Here is a visual representation with a short description of the connections between the tables:\n```sql\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n|   Users        | --------------------- |    Offers      |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n       |                                          | has\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n|   Geolocation  |                       |   Payment      |\n+----------------+                       |   Provider     |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Transactions   |                       |   Campaign     |\n+----------------+                       |     Type       |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n|   Points       |                       | Offer Status   |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n       |                                          | has\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Bonus Retries  |                       |   Dynamic      |\n+----------------+                       |  Odds System   |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Referral       |                       |   Offerwall    |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Player Wallet  |                       | Confirmation   |\n+----------------+                       |   of Transaction|\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n       |                                          |\n+----------------+                       +----------------+\n| Merchant       |                       |    Game        |\n| Reporting      |                       +----------------+\n+----------------+\n```\n* Users table: Stores information about the users of the system.\n* Geolocation table: Stores the geographical location of the user.\n* Transactions table: Stores information about transactions made by users.\n* Points table: Stores the points earned by users.\n* Bonus Retries table: Stores information about bonus retries.\n* Merchant Credit table: Stores information about the merchant's credit.\n* Bank Linked table: Stores information about the user's bank account linked to the system.\n* Referral Program table: Stores information about the referral program.\n* Player Wallet table: Stores information about the user's wallet.\n* Offer Status table: Stores information about the status of the offers.\n* Transaction Date table: Stores information about the date of the transaction.\n* Points Earned table: Stores information about the points earned by the user.\n* Merchant Reporting table: Stores information about the merchant's reporting.\n* Campaign Type table: Stores information about the type of campaign.\n* Credit Reward Campaign table: Stores information about the credit reward campaign.\n* Cash Reward Campaign ta