INFO 09-15 16:12:24 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-f90624771b164bb1b1cf4e09ef16215b-0: prompt: 'Macaque paces back and forth in the small cage, his mind racing. He\'s been trying to come up with a plan to escape or defeat Wukong since he was thrown into the cage, but nothing seems to be working.\n\nMK is sleeping peacefully on the other side of the cage. Macaque looks over at him and feels a pang of guilt. This was all his fault. He should have never agreed to Wukong\'s demands.\n\nHe looks back to the entrance of the cave, where he knows Wukong is probably gloating to his monkey subjects. He can\'t stand the thought of being trapped in this cage forever, but he can\'t come up with a way out.\n\nMacaque sighs and sits down next to MK. He watches him sleep for a moment, feeling a small glimmer of hope. Maybe they can escape together. He gently shakes MK awake.\n\n"Hey, MK," he whispers. "We need to talk."\n\nMK blinks groggily and rubs his eyes. "What\'s wrong?"\n\n"I\'ve been thinking, and I don\'t know if we can get out of here on our own," Macaque admits. "But maybe we can try to get some help."\n\n"Help? From who?"\n\n"I don\'t know yet," Macaque admits. "But we have to try something. We can\'t just give up."\n\nMK looks at him skeptically. "What do you have in mind?"\n\nMacaque hesitates for a moment before speaking. "There\'s someone I know who might be able to help us. But it\'s risky."\n\n"Who?" MK presses.\n\nMacaque takes a deep breath. "The Jade Emperor."\n\nMK\'s eyes widen in shock. "The Jade Emperor? But he\'s Wukong\'s boss!"\n\n"I know," Macaque says. "But he\'s also the most powerful god in all of heaven. If anyone can help us, it\'s him."\n\nMK looks uncertain. "But how are we going to contact him? And even if we do, how do we know he\'ll help us?"\n\nMacaque grins, feeling a glimmer of hope. "I have a plan."', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, 