 16%|█▌        | 159/1000 [00:21<02:03,  6.83it/s]INFO 09-15 16:12:29 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-33f4ab5f5c06439696c080d61c9f8e13-0: prompt: 'Web search results:\n\n[1] "Companies listed in this directory hold major market share in different business sectors in Nigeria. The directory contains brief profiles of 6000 companies including their contact details, phone numbers, emails, management, staff strength, etc. 6000 profiles birthed NG Contacts due to its huge success."\nURL: https://www.entrepreneurs.ng/free-business-directories-in-nigeria/\n\n[2] "Listing your business in local business listing websites is a great way to increase your business online visibility, reputation, and branding. Local business listing websites help a business to get more traffic from its target customers. If you are visible in front of your target customers, you will get more traffic and leads."\nURL: https://invoice.ng/blog/business-listing-sites-in-nigeria/\n\n[3] "Nairaland Forum - This business directory was created in 2005 by Seun Osewa and is one of the most revered in the country. It was ranked one of the most visible business directories in Nigeria and can act as a marketplace for entrepreneurs and consumers. Yalwa Business Directory - Yalwa is exceptional when it comes to connecting users to local ..."\nURL: https://www.kenyanz.com/articles/13-best-local-nigeria-business-directories\n\n[4] "If you want a local customers search engine, this platform helps businesses and companies who need customers to find them in Nigeria, West Africa and across the world. Its has a huge list of companies in Nigeria and their email addresses and other contact details. #5. Vconnect Nigeria."\nURL: https://abbakin.com/top-20-nigeria-business-directories/\n\n[5] "4 Location-Based Business Listing Sites Creating Business Listing on Local Business Listing Sites or Citation Sites is the process of getting your business listed on local web directories. The most common and most popular example of a citation site is Yelp. You must have heard about Yelp or some other similar websites like Realtors, BBB etc."\nURL: https://www.incrementors.com/blog/top-local-business-listing-sites-for-your-niche-location/\n\n[6] "Get a Lagos Business Listing Lagos latest business listings Olam Nigeria Limited Abulana village lagos | Lagos, Nigeria 08061148152 We manufacture and distribute packaged food products to Af... Food Wholesalers, Lagos 5 6 abulana village road., Abulana village lagos, Lagos, 100001 Give Away Marketplace logas | Lagos, Nigeria"\nURL: https://localsmall.business/lagos/\n\n[7] "Local Small Business in Abuja, Nigeria Welcome to our Abuja, Nigeria business directory. Search within our catalogue to find local small businesses near you or get your own business listed here. Browse companies in Abuja locally near you offering their services to the public. Are you a business owner?"\nURL: https://localsmall.business/abuja/\nCurrent date: 2/2/2023\n\nInstructions: Using the provided web search results, write a comprehensive reply to the given query. Make sure to cite results using [[number](URL)] notation after the reference. If the provided search results refer to multiple subjects with the same name, write separate answers for each subject.\nQuery: List local directories and citations for a small business in Nigeria', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=346, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 6721, 3927, 2536, 236787, 108, 236840, 236770, 236842, 623, 86561, 9456, 528, 672, 12229, 2768, 3262, 2436, 4024, 528, 1607, 1960, 18597, 528, 16210, 236761, 669, 12229, 6097, 8652, 2