 20%|█▉        | 199/1000 [00:30<01:30,  8.89it/s]INFO 09-15 16:12:37 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-f0fd9983f38847419ea72a24e1f1af98-0: prompt: 'Here are a few books you may find useful in your study of matcha tea, chado, and the ingredients:\n\n1. "The Book of Matcha: Recipes and Rituals" by Katie Potts\n2. "Chado: The Way of Tea" by Sen Soshitsu XV\n3. "Herbs for a Healthy Aging" by Robin Rose Bennett\n4. "The Tao of Tea: The Serene Pleasure" by Dan Lusthaus\n5. "Herbal Medicine: Biomolecular and Clinical Aspects" by E. Habtemariam\n\nNote that these are a starting point and you may find other resources and references that are more applicable to your study of the topic.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=16, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 8291, 659, 496, 2321, 6249, 611, 1149, 1586, 6684, 528, 822, 2748, 529, 214444, 11115, 236764, 677, 1438, 236764, 532, 506, 13153, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 623, 818, 7167, 529, 223867, 236787, 83685, 532, 117332, 236751, 236775, 684, 54419, 150923, 107, 236778, 236761, 623, 1659, 1438, 236787, 669, 10957, 529, 34933, 236775, 684, 6122, 555, 8507, 64056, 24174, 107, 236800, 236761, 623, 16900, 1886, 573, 496, 35005, 84007, 236775, 684, 33938, 16402, 42793, 107, 236812, 236761, 623, 818, 59909, 529, 34933, 236787, 669, 4028, 1633, 156324, 236775, 684, 6624, 94845, 21801, 107, 236810, 236761, 623, 16900, 2265, 16802, 236787, 102853, 27208, 532, 28989, 95677, 236775, 684, 645, 236761, 22146, 3412, 186961, 108, 10282, 600, 1239, 659, 496, 6250, 1523, 532, 611, 1149, 1586, 1032, 5405, 532, 16441, 600, 659, 919, 11955, 531, 822, 274