INFO 09-15 16:12:41 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-6c99c2636cbc4859a85b653cfb9a0ec0-0: prompt: 'Write a 500-800 word linkedin article about putting the human in the center of change.\nInclude the following key points:\nA few weeks ago, a Digital Executive at a large Swiss corporate asked me if Ginetta could also support on their Digital Business Strategy. I said “It depends. If you are looking for a 300-page strategy paper, then probably not. However, if you are looking to create a Digital Business Strategy that is truly customer-centered, then maybe yes”.\nMy point was that we are not a business consulting firm that creates 5-year transformation programs, with the hope that change will come out at the other end of the tunnel.\nWe are a Digital Experience Company. And part of that is Strategy too. However, everything we do needs to have a clear purpose with the human in the center.\nSo often, companies approach change management top down. They hire consultants to map out change programs and transformation initiatives. And they often look very good on paper. However, they are also often hard to put into practice because they are detached from the human.\nMaking change is hard. People, by design, don’t want to change. Sure, some do. But most don’t.\nHowever, change is almost impossible if you don’t put the human in the center. \n\nWrite in a thought-provoking, persuasive, conversational and inspiring tone of voice, that speaks directly to the reader.\nFirst, write an attention-grabbing introduction that hooks the reader and sets the stage for the rest of the article.\nThroughout the article, use a clear and logical structure, with subheadings to make the article easy to read and digest.\nAsk questions in the article to encourage engagement and start a conversation.\nFinish with a call-to-action to reach out and have an exchange.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=770, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 6974, 496, 236743, 236810, 236771, 236771, 236772, 236828, 236771, 236771, 3658, 213898, 4676, 1003, 10848, 506, 3246, 528, 506, 3988, 529, 2352, 236761, 107, 33588, 506, 2269, 2307, 3298, 236787, 107, 236776, 2321, 5695, 4578, 236764, 496, 14232, 15044, 657, 496, 2455, 28215, 11961, 4733, 786, 768, 667, 8895, 1246, 1451, 992, 1894, 580, 910, 14232, 7449, 34428, 236761, 564, 1176, 999, 1509, 9796, 236761, 1637, 611, 659, 3182, 573, 496, 236743, 236800, 236771, 236771, 236772, 4000, 7545, 3627, 236764, 1299, 4516, 711, 236761, 3153, 236764, 768, 611, 659, 3182, 531, 2619, 496, 14232, 7449, 34428, 600, 563, 9995, 5602, 236772, 51257, 236764, 1299, 7463, 11262, 5043, 107, 4754, 1523, 691, 600, 692, 659, 711, 496, 1960, 31100, 6218, 600, 14004, 236743, 236810, 236772, 3704, 11918, 6607, 236764, 607, 506, 4614, 600, 2352, 795, 2229, 855, 657, 506, 1032, 1345, 529, 506, 22728, 236761, 107, 1882, 659, 496, 14232, 20369, 6503, 236761, 1452, 912, 529, 600, 563, 34428, 2311, 236761, 3153, 236764, 4326, 692, 776, 3548, 531, 735, 496, 3582, 5708, 607, 506, 3246, 528, 506, 3988, 236761, 107, 4324, 3187, 236764, 4699, 4313, 2352, 3997, 1903, 1679, 236761, 2195, 20947, 49844, 531, 4187, 855, 2352, 6607, 532, 11918, 19898, 236761, 1452, 901, 3187, 1385, 1401, 1535, 580, 3627, 236761, 3153, 236764, 901, 659, 992, 3187, 2651, 531, 2247, 1131, 5428, 1547, 901, 659, 58087, 699, 506, 3246, 236761, 107, 41950, 2352, 563, 2651, 236761, 9432, 236764, 684, 1702, 236764, 1537, 236858, 236745, 1461, 531, 2352, 236761, 26145, 236764, 1070, 776, 236761, 2024, 1346, 1537, 236858, 236745, 236761, 107, 9675, 236764, 2352, 563, 4180, 11449, 768, 611, 1537, 236858, 236