 23%|██▎       | 227/1000 [00:34<02:23,  5.40it/s]INFO 09-15 16:12:42 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-3227f36a2df94452b207cb2f6568cd41-0: prompt: "One day, Lucy's sister Emily was tidying up the living room when she accidentally sucked Lucy up with the vacuum cleaner. Emily had been moving the vacuum around the room, trying to get all of the dust and dirt off the floor, when she suddenly felt the vacuum start to pull harder than usual.\n\nShe looked down and saw that the vacuum hose had sucked up Lucy, who was lying on the floor at the time. Emily immediately panicked and turned off the vacuum, fearing that she had injured her sister.\n\nWhen she pulled the hose out, she saw that Lucy was flattened even more than usual, and she looked quite scared and upset. Emily immediately apologized and helped Lucy sit up, trying to comfort her and make sure that she was okay.\n\nDespite her initial fright, Lucy was relieved to see that she was unharmed. She laughed and told Emily not to worry, saying that she had always been a bit of a troublemaker and that this was just one more adventure to add to her list.\n\nFeeling relieved and grateful that her sister was okay, Emily helped Lucy back to her usual spot on the floor and promised to be more careful in the future. From then on, Emily made sure to keep a close eye on Lucy whenever she was using the vacuum, making sure that she didn't accidentally suck her up again.\n\nDespite the occasional mishap, the sisters continued to have fun and enjoy each other's company, always looking out for one another and supporting each other through thick and thin.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=11, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, tr