 25%|██▍       | 247/1000 [00:39<03:38,  3.45it/s]INFO 09-15 16:12:47 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-82e505e9e16b48af95b0eaaac9a475bf-0: prompt: "Coupa, Athena, and SAP HANA are all different types of software that have different uses and capabilities.\n\n1. Coupa is a cloud-based software platform that provides businesses with a suite of financial management tools, specifically designed to help businesses manage their spending, from procurement to invoicing and payments.\n2. Athena is a program developed by Amazon Web Services (AWS) that allows users to run SQL-like queries on data stored in Amazon S3, a cloud-based object storage service. It is used for data lake, data warehousing and big data analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning scenarios.\n3. SAP HANA is an in-memory data platform that is used to process high-volume, real-time data. It provides advanced analytics, data processing, and application development capabilities.\n\nA Project Lead is a person who is responsible for managing and coordinating the implementation of a project. In this context, a Project Lead for the implementation of Coupa, Athena, and SAP HANA would be responsible for managing the process of implementing these systems within an organization. The project lead would be responsible for ensuring that the project is completed on time, within budget, and to the satisfaction of all stakeholders. The Project Lead would be the main point of contact between the organization and the vendors, and would be responsible for managing the project team, which can include internal staff and external consultants.\n\nThe Project Lead would need to have a good understanding of the organization's business processes, as well as the capabilities and limitations of the software being implemented. They should have experience managing projects and leading teams, as well as strong communication, problem-solving, and leadership skills.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=12, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 40867, 4423, 236764, 93100, 236764, 532, 35031, 194769, 659, 784, 1607, 4458, 529, 5368, 600, 735, 1607, 6178, 532, 15858, 236761, 108, 236770, 236761, 18306, 4423, 563, 496, 6425, 236772, 5140, 5368, 5058, 600, 4728, 8634, 607, 496, 16848, 529, 4867, 3997, 6436, 236764, 10916, 5402, 531, 1601, 8634, 9688, 910, 11704, 236764, 699, 41108, 531, 234523, 532, 13192, 236761, 107, 236778, 236761, 93100, 563, 496, 1948, 5535, 684, 9593, 6940, 8381, 568, 55205, 236768, 600, 5862, 5089, 531, 1845, 15963, 236772, 5282, 27490, 580, 1262, 11628, 528, 9593, 555, 236800, 236764, 496, 6425, 236772, 5140, 2495, 6310, 2509, 236761, 1030, 563, 1456, 573, 1262, 13288, 236764, 1262, 147196, 532, 2563, 1262, 26545, 236764, 1960, 14020, 236764, 532, 5464, 4735, 25521, 236761, 107, 236800, 236761, 35031, 194769, 563, 614, 528, 236772, 20624, 1262, 5058, 600, 563, 1456, 531, 1657, 1494, 236772, 20845, 236764, 1759, 236772, 2289, 1262, 236761, 1030, 4728, 9691, 26545, 236764, 1262, 8487, 236764, 532, 3739, 2913, 15858, 236761, 108, 236776, 7879, 35024, 563, 496, 1589, 1015, 563, 7757, 573, 15724, 532, 64451, 506, 8688, 529, 496, 2203, 236761, 799, 672, 4403, 236764, 496, 7879, 35024, 573, 506, 8688, 529, 18306, 4423, 236764, 93100, 236764, 532, 35031, 194769, 1093, 577, 7757, 573, 15724, 506, 1657, 529, 22743, 1239, 3797, 2351, 614, 6261, 236761, 669, 2203, 2080, 1093, 577, 7757, 573, 17096, 600, 506, 2203, 563, 7723, 580, 990, 236764, 2351, 7715, 236764, 532, 531, 506, 17681, 529, 784, 23095, 236761, 669, 7879, 35024, 1093, 577, 506, 1689, 1523, 529, 3662, 1534, 506, 6261, 532, 506, 290