INFO 09-15 16:12:48 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-9028db18eca44b0ca55c61be87ab2c24-0: prompt: "Yes, integrating drone imagery and machine learning algorithms into the app can help farmers identify pests and recommend appropriate pest control strategies. Here's an example of how the code for the app could be updated to include this feature:\n```python\nimport cv2\nimport numpy as np\nimport requests\n\n# Function to detect pests in drone images\ndef detect_pests(image_url):\n    # Download the image from the provided URL\n    response = requests.get(image_url)\n    image_array = np.asarray(bytearray(response.content), dtype=np.uint8)\n    image = cv2.imdecode(image_array, cv2.IMREAD_COLOR)\n\n    # Convert the image to grayscale and apply a Gaussian blur\n    gray = cv2.cvtColor(image, cv2.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)\n    blurred = cv2.GaussianBlur(gray, (5, 5), 0)\n\n    # Apply Canny edge detection\n    edged = cv2.Canny(blurred, 30, 150)\n\n    # Find contours in the image\n    contours, hierarchy = cv2.findContours(edged, cv2.RETR_EXTERNAL, cv2.CHAIN_APPROX_SIMPLE)\n\n    # Initialize variables to keep track of pest count and types\n    pest_count = 0\n    pest_types = []\n\n    # Loop through the contours and check if they match any known pest patterns\n    for contour in contours:\n        # Check if the contour matches a known pest pattern\n        if check_for_pest(contour):\n            pest_count += 1\n            pest_types.append(get_pest_type(contour))\n\n    # Return the pest count and types\n    return pest_count, pest_types\n\n# Function to check if a contour matches a known pest pattern\ndef check_for_pest(contour):\n    # Implement pest pattern detection algorithm\n    ...\n\n# Function to get the type of pest based on its contour\ndef get_pest_type(contour):\n    # Implement pest type detection algorithm\n    ...\n\n# Sample usage of detect_pests function\nimage_url = 'https://example.com/drone_image.jpg'\npest_count, pest_types = detect_pests(image_url)\nprint(f'Found {pest_count} pests of types {pest_types} in the image.')\n```\nIn addition to the above code, the app can also provide recommendations for appropriate pest control strategies based on the types of pests detected. This can be achieved by incorporating machine learning algorithms that analyze past pest control data and recommend appropriate strategies based on the detected pests.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=35, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 10784, 236764, 37803, 19311, 41001, 532, 5464, 4735, 17927, 1131, 506, 850, 740, 1601, 14369, 8701, 53235, 532, 5840, 6780, 35889, 2256, 11298, 236761, 5715, 236789, 236751, 614, 2591, 529, 1217, 506, 3393, 573, 506, 850, 1451, 577, 10448, 531, 3204, 672, 4926, 236787, 107, 2717, 6719, 107, 1106, 10137, 236778, 107, 1106, 16908, 618, 5266, 107, 1106, 10512, 108, 236865, 12939, 531, 6440, 53235, 528, 19311, 4876, 107, 2063, 6440, 236779, 236758, 7573, 236769, 3304, 236779, 2451, 1473, 107, 140, 236865, 15993, 506, 2471, 699, 506, 3847, 10739, 107, 140, 6275, 578, 10512, 236761, 828, 236769, 3304, 236779, 2451, 236768, 107, 140, 3304, 236779, 2513, 578, 5266, 236761, 84623, 236769, 12247, 2513, 236769, 6275, 236761, 3955, 779, 29383, 236784, 8435, 236761, 9890, 236828, 236768, 107, 140, 3304, 578, 10137, 236778, 236761, 548, 22360, 236769, 3304, 236779, 2513, 236764, 10137, 236778, 236761, 2783, 11913, 236779, 31976, 236768, 108, 140, 236865, 24439, 506, 2471, 531, 92715, 532, 5510, 496, 32290, 16645, 107, 140, 16024, 578, 10137, 236778, 236761, 85420, 236769, 3304, 236764, 10137, 236778, 236761, 31976, 236779, 8611