ull-stack web application for managing faculty and student details of the college.\n• Built REST API for performing CRUD operations on the DB.\n• Created role-based authentication, admin dashboard, and home dashboard, to cut down the complexity of assigning and\nswitching user access rights, and increase efficiency by 60%.\n• Improved the system’s scalability by handling traffic of more than 50 concurrent users per week.\n• Implemented feature for exporting reports in Excel or PDF format with pagination, reducing the export time by 80%.\nIntercessor- An Inventory management system | ARIMA model, Python, HTML, CSS, Flask\n• Developed a full ML-based warehouse inventory system to counter food wastage by 40%.\n• Incorporated ARIMA model for prediction of sales with 92% of accuracy.\n• Created a chatbot to handle user queries along with an IVR system.\nAwards and Achievements\nCMR Leadership Awardee Nov 2022\nAwarded the CMR Leadership Award for exemplary behavior and achievements. CMR Group, Bengaluru\nSemi-Finalist in IICDC Aug 2021\nLed team in the National Innovation Challenge conducted by Texas Instruments. Texas Instruments\nChattra Vishwakarma Awards Aug 2021\nRepresented team in the finals of the national level hackathon conducted by AICTE. AICTE Vishwakarma Awards\nNational Innovation hackathon Sept 2020\nSecured 16th rank all over India in the national hack challenge conducted by IBM. IBM\nFirst Place in TYL Hackathons (C++, python, Machine Learning, Full-Stack) June 2020\nWon 3 consecutive semesters of the 24 hrs algorithm-based hackathon conducted by CMRIT. CMRIT, Bengaluru', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=41, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_pr