INFO 09-15 16:13:00 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-74cef13b7cab4c038e92a653df874676-0: prompt: "Meilisearch supports searching with different character sets out-of-the-box. Meilisearch uses Unicode Normalization Form D (NFD) for indexing and searching. This means that all characters are normalized to their decomposed form, which allows Meilisearch to handle diacritics, ligatures, and other complex characters in a consistent way.\n\nMeilisearch also provides built-in support for languages with different character sets. When indexing documents, Meilisearch automatically detects the language of each document and applies language-specific rules to improve search accuracy. Meilisearch currently supports over 50 different languages, including Arabic, Cyrillic, Latin, and more.\n\nTo set up dynamic fuzziness with Meilisearch, you can use the `typoTolerance` parameter in your search queries. The `typoTolerance` parameter controls the level of fuzziness allowed in your search results, and can be set to a value between `0` and `2`. A value of `0` means that only exact matches will be returned, while a value of `2` allows for more fuzzy matches. You can set the `typoTolerance` parameter dynamically based on user input or other factors.\n\nHere's an example of a search query with dynamic fuzziness using the Meilisearch JavaScript SDK:\n```javascript\nconst { MeiliSearch } = require('meilisearch');\n\nconst meilisearch = new MeiliSearch({\n  host: 'http://localhost:7700',\n  apiKey: 'masterKey', // This is the default API key for a new Meilisearch instance\n});\n\nconst index = meilisearch.getIndex('my_index');\n\nconst query = 'John Doe';\nconst fuzziness = 1; // Set fuzziness based on user input or other factors\n\nconst searchResults = await index.search(query, {\n  typoTolerance: fuzziness,\n});\n\nconsole.log(searchResults.hits);\n```\nIn this example, the `typoTolerance` parameter is set to a dynamic value (`fuzziness`) based on user input or other factors. You can adjust the value of `fuzziness` as needed to control the level of fuzziness in your search results.\n\nOverall, Meilisearch provides a powerful and flexible search solution that can handle different character sets and provide dynamic fuzziness options.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=23, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 5191, 26082, 3531, 12765, 19460, 607, 1607, 2872, 7093, 855, 236772, 1340, 236772, 1437, 236772, 2566, 236761, 3060, 26082, 3531, 6178, 26626, 25126, 1854, 5959, 622, 568, 236797, 35023, 236768, 573, 71851, 532, 19460, 236761, 1174, 2820, 600, 784, 7579, 659, 30611, 531, 910, 81153, 1183, 236764, 837, 5862, 3060, 26082, 3531, 531, 6060, 1001, 552, 1302, 1229, 236764, 13300, 2746, 236764, 532, 1032, 3996, 7579, 528, 496, 9958, 1595, 236761, 108, 5191, 26082, 3531, 992, 4728, 5284, 236772, 495, 1894, 573, 15579, 607, 1607, 2872, 7093, 236761, 3026, 71851, 9413, 236764, 3060, 26082, 3531, 11269, 76886, 506, 5192, 529, 1546, 2354, 532, 16819, 5192, 236772, 15396, 6366, 531, 4006, 3927, 10634, 236761, 3060, 26082, 3531, 5633, 12765, 1024, 236743, 236810, 236771, 1607, 15579, 236764, 2440, 37369, 236764, 78981, 644, 525, 236764, 16403, 236764, 532, 919, 236761, 108, 2021, 1076, 872, 10795, 164186, 1583, 607, 3060, 26082, 3531, 236764, 611, 740, 1161, 506, 2165, 1363, 2661, 182499, 236929, 7689, 528, 822, 3927, 27490, 236761, 669, 2165, 1363, 2661, 182499, 236929, 7689, 12239, 506, 1984, 529, 164186, 1583, 6208, 528, 822, 3927, 2536, 236764, 532, 740, 577, 1076, 531, 496, 1550, 1534, 2165, 236771, 236929, 532, 2165, 236778, 21233, 562, 1550, 529, 2165, 236771, 236