 38%|███▊      | 379/1000 [00:58<01:35,  6.50it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:05 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-02640886e4204a6c9a2ea6303a14f912-0: prompt: "As Zoey's skills improved, she began to attract the attention of the woodland creatures living near the enchanted court. They were intrigued by her determination and progress, and some of them decided to challenge her in a friendly dribbling contest. Zoey, eager to test her skills and learn from others, gladly accepted the challenge.\n\nThe dribbling contest featured a series of one-on-one matchups against various forest animals, each with their own unique dribbling style. Zoey faced off against a nimble rabbit with lightning-fast moves, a clever raccoon with tricky feints, and a graceful deer with a smooth, gliding stride. Each opponent presented a new challenge, and Zoey absorbed the lessons they offered.\n\nWith every contest, Zoey's dribbling skills grew stronger and more versatile. She combined her own techniques with the ones she learned from her opponents, becoming a formidable ball-handler. As the competition came to a close, Zoey thanked the forest animals for the opportunity to learn from them and looked forward to facing them again in the future.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=10, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2205, 36004, 1072, 236789, 236751, 6130, 9806, 236764, 1304, 6074, 531, 7440, 506, 5700, 529, 506, 64719, 28682, 4882, 3541, 506, 144044, 4054, 236761, 2195, 964, 91651, 684, 1116, 13699, 532, 5609, 236764, 532, 1070, 529, 1091, 6544, 531, 8319, 1116, 528, 496, 10841, 119083, 13599, 14779, 236761, 3600