INFO 09-15 16:13:07 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-a61a925b50ca444699e8984248d29457-0: prompt: 'In "The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time," there are several different realms or locations that Link can visit. These include:\n\n* Hyrule: The main kingdom where much of the game takes place. It is home to various towns, forests, mountains, and other areas.\n* The Lost Woods: A mysterious forest located in Hyrule that is home to the Kokiri, a race of child-like beings.\n* The Sacred Realm: A mystical dimension that is home to the Triforce, a powerful magical artifact that grants wishes to those who possess it.\n* The Dark World: A twisted, alternate version of Hyrule that is accessed through the use of special stones called the Pendants of Virtue.\n* The Temple of Time: A sacred temple located in Hyrule that is home to the Master Sword, a powerful weapon that can defeat evil.\n\nThese are some of the main realms that are featured in "Ocarina of Time," but there are many other smaller locations and areas that Link can visit as well.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=7, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 902, 623, 818, 38947, 529, 114688, 236787, 708, 4554, 1630, 529, 7578, 2098, 993, 659, 3131, 1607, 97722, 653, 11024, 600, 10297, 740, 3517, 236761, 3143, 3204, 236787, 108, 236829, 10509, 21173, 236787, 669, 1689, 21880, 1298, 1623, 529, 506, 2290, 4716, 1977, 236761, 1030, 563, 2033, 531, 3572, 21274, 236764, 24599, 236764, 13254, 236764, 532, 1032, 4106, 236761, 107, 236829, 669, 42327, 38476, 236787, 562, 34640, 6426, 5628, 528, 10509, 21173, 600, 563, 2033, 531, 506, 5598