INFO 09-15 16:13:10 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-5c692bd986db4beb87d18754b48f28a0-0: prompt: 'Sure, here is a revised version of the video script that focuses on event rewards and includes a more conversational opening:\n\nTitle: "Boost Your Event Sales by 50% with the Right Rewards Program"\n\nSticker Text: Event Marketing: Boost Sales with Rewards\n\nDescription:\nDiscover the secrets to a successful event rewards program #events #eventmarketing #eventrewards\n\nScript:\n\nAre you having a hard time selling tickets to your events? Don\'t worry, we\'ve all been there.\n\nBut there\'s one tool that can give you a huge advantage in the event market: a rewards program.\n\nIn a study by Harvard Business Review, a rewards program done right was shown to increase sales by 50%. That\'s right, 50%!\n\nRewards programs are a great way to boost sales for a few reasons. First, they create a sense of exclusivity. People love feeling like they\'re part of an exclusive club, and rewards programs provide a way to give your most loyal customers special perks and privileges.\n\nSecond, they encourage repeat business. By offering rewards for attending multiple events, you can create a sense of loyalty among your customers and encourage them to come back again and again.\n\nFinally, rewards programs can be tailored to the specific needs and interests of your audience. This allows you to create a program that resonates with your customers and keeps them engaged and motivated to attend your events.\n\nSo if you\'re looking for a way to boost sales and create a more loyal and engaged customer base, consider implementing a rewards program. With the right planning and execution, you can see a significant increase in ticket sales.\n\nIf you want to learn more about how to create a successful event rewards program and follow our journey in the world of event marketing, be sure to follow our account for more tips and insights.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequ