 49%|████▉     | 489/1000 [01:11<00:43, 11.63it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:19 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-335178d1ae114f2f94a7dcdbd503afa4-0: prompt: "Sure, I can update step 3 to include the billing address with detailed demographic information. Here's the updated step:\n\nStep 3: Enter Store Name, Customer Information, and Billing Address\nEnter the store name, customer's information, and billing address in the fields provided. This includes their name, email address, phone number, and any other relevant information such as their date of birth, gender, and occupation. For the billing address, enter the street address, city, state or province, and postal or zip code. You can also attach any identification documents provided by the customer.\n\nBy adding the billing address with detailed demographic information, call center agents can ensure that the customer's account is properly set up and any future billing or shipping information is accurate and up-to-date.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=15, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 49190, 236764, 564, 740, 4610, 2918, 236743, 236800, 531, 3204, 506, 47764, 3421, 607, 9813, 46144, 1938, 236761, 5715, 236789, 236751, 506, 10448, 2918, 236787, 108, 5471, 236743, 236800, 236787, 10152, 13516, 7343, 236764, 17438, 8230, 236764, 532, 117229, 15874, 107, 8955, 506, 4762, 1463, 236764, 5602, 236789, 236751, 1938, 236764, 532, 47764, 3421, 528, 506, 6192, 3847, 236761, 1174, 5132, 910, 1463, 236764, 4553, 3421, 236764, 5154, 1548, 236764, 532, 1027, 1032, 7798, 1938, 1288, 618, 910, 3433, 529, 6681, 236764, 13435, 236764, 532, 30462