INFO 09-15 16:13:20 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-d6bf35775bd0405ea58f77d62a9b22d8-0: prompt: "Suddenly, the telescreen on the wall flickered to life, and the face of Big Brother appeared on the screen.\n\nBig Brother: (in his deep, booming voice) Good evening, citizens. I hope you are all well.\n\nEveryone in the room immediately stood up and faced the telescreen.\n\nO'Brien: (respectfully) Good evening, Big Brother. We are all doing well, thank you.\n\nBig Brother: (smiling) I'm glad to hear it. I have been monitoring your conversation, and I must say, I am pleased with what I hear. It's important that we all remain loyal to the Party and its ideals.\n\nWinston: (under his breath) And there it is. The ever-watchful eye of Big Brother.\n\nJulia: (noticing Winston's discomfort) Don't worry, Winston. We have to play along, for now. But one day, we will overthrow the Party and restore our freedom.\n\nBig Brother: (interrupting) I trust that you are all working diligently towards the betterment of our society. Remember, the Party knows what's best for you. We are all in this together.\n\nSyme: (nodding eagerly) Yes, Big Brother. We are all committed to the Party and its goals.\n\nBig Brother: (smiling) Excellent. Keep up the good work, citizens. Big Brother is watching you.\n\nThe telescreen went dark, and the room fell silent for a few moments.\n\nO'Brien: (breaking the silence) Well, I think it's time for us to go to bed. We all have a busy day ahead of us.\n\nEveryone agreed, and they all said their goodnights before heading off to their separate quarters. But as they drifted off to sleep, they all knew that their rebellion against the Party was far from over.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=10, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_l