 52%|█████▏    | 521/1000 [01:15<01:00,  7.86it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:23 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-02397c9e7de649b0b8260ceeb2a2c344-0: prompt: "I also thought it would allow “certified” trainers to reach a bigger audience through the AR capabilities of today's phones. Usually, this remote support use of AI AR is used in the field service area. The ability to provide overlays, workflows, and zoom-like sessions could be used by dog trainers. Even retired ones provide one on one paid training to more people everywhere. They could also use LLM services like this to automate a lot of the work and homework/lessons for the users. Please expand on this and include it with the previous chats. As always we want to fully leverage generative AI and AR as our core underpinnings in everything we do - always keep this in mind and get creative and add more ideas how we can connect and engage this community", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=440, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 236777, 992, 3305, 625, 1093, 2174, 999, 94636, 236919, 55977, 531, 5370, 496, 12869, 9998, 1343, 506, 8886, 15858, 529, 3124, 236789, 236751, 23319, 236761, 34645, 236764, 672, 10883, 1894, 1161, 529, 12498, 8886, 563, 1456, 528, 506, 2135, 2509, 2433, 236761, 669, 5596, 531, 2847, 144668, 236764, 81014, 236764, 532, 18384, 236772, 5282, 14845, 1451, 577, 1456, 684, 4799, 55977, 236761, 7712, 21136, 5906, 2847, 886, 580, 886, 6382, 4122, 531, 919, 1331, 17134, 236761, 2195, 1451, 992, 1161, 32050, 236792, 3019, 1133, 672, 531, 62530, 496, 2606, 529, 506, 981, 532, 28966, 236786, 111975, 573, 506, 5089, 23676