INFO 09-15 16:13:25 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-2878e646bce64df0b90740634cd5d300-0: prompt: '11. Inside the zone, mental health isn\'t considered to be too important, and it\'s mostly just swept under the rug, or left to priests and shamans to resolve. People usually work 24/7 to produce food, or hunt, or fix things, sew clothes etc. so they are pretty much brutal to everyone\'s health issues, including their own. It\'s pretty much the wild west, or the age of pioneer explorers there. The lands not directly ruled by Hybrids are a patchwork of nomadic tribes, small totalitarian states, princedoms who systematically don\'t care about mental health of their subjects. Inside the hybrid kingdoms, the people can always rely on confessing to an AI, or to medical officers who have a status similar to that of clergy.\n\n12. Will probably address that later when I shape more of the socio-economic and historical parts of the worldbuilding.\n\n13. There are many legends, the most common are just shaped around biblical stories. None of them are close to the truth, as the events that lead to the EMP and the Tiamat zone have mostly happened in secret.\n\n14. everything outside the hybrid kingdoms is basically lawless. Vigilantism, revenge, vendetta, slavery have become the norm. There are a few "oasis" of feudalism, which are considered to be "great civilizations" of this era.\n\n15. It has all shifted towards survival, as anyone from the zone who desires more knowledge has to go to the coastal city states, or elsewhere, where the chances are this person will be killed or enslaved. The few who manage to enroll into schools in the city-states or elsewhere outside the zone are usually disappointed to find nothing revealing, they\'re just recruited into whatever is useful to the hybrids, rulers of the city-states, or tribes, or they are trained as spies to return to the zone and inform on their kin.\n\n16. Inside the zone the gender roles have mostly reverted to a patriarchal system similar to the 19th century. The Hybrid kingdoms have a complex world of genders, where the genetically and technologically augmented humans have many new sexual roles. There\'s also a caste of "Eunuchs" who are created from male children against their will. These are prized by all the rulers for being industrious and loyal. The Hybrids are working on improved versions of completely asexual humans who would focus on being loyal and resourceful for the masters. There are many women who are genetically grown to be much more powerful and intelligent than men, so this also creates new dynamics in relationships. \n\n17. yes, many black markets and trade posts which shift location for fear of raiders.\n\n18. depends on the area. The Hybrid kingdoms have evolved strict castes, each having their own laws, and the relations between the castes are arbitrated by the Hybrids themselves.\n\n19. Inside the zone, people live free from oppressive governments, but are limited by their own customs, traditions, and of course limited with the time and effort they have to dedicate to sheer survival. The Hybrid kingdoms\' folk are aware of the oppressive nature of their government(s), but they usually gladly give up their freedom for safety, housing, food, water etc.\n\n20. With great effort.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 236770, 236770, 236761, 35197, 506, 10202, 236764, 9069, 2404, 5889, 236789, 236745, 4542, 531, 577, 2311, 2132, 236764, 532, 625, 236789, 236751, 10723, 1164, 45445, 1208, 506, 17558, 236764, 653, 2378, 531, 48034, 532, 60908,