 55%|█████▌    | 553/1000 [01:19<01:08,  6.54it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:27 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-005dade6c825435cb625460391e00b80-0: prompt: 'I am creating a role for a derivative operations in Arizona that has the normal derivative roles. It will also have more an oversight and operational risk role for the system we use, Calypso. The system has 3 main uses, for collateral management, derivative operations, and counterparts risk. This team would ensure that the proper controls for the system are in place. These would be around the scheduled tasks that generate the daily processes/data, and making sure the task manager, which handles exceptions, is organized and efficiently identifying issues. They would work with our SOX team, our audit team, and operational risk team for the greater investment operations. They would also ensure that procedures are in place and that we have enough coverage for the globe to efficiently manage the operations. I really think that they would help make senior leadership feel good that this complex system, Calypso, is running smoothly and the controls are in place to identify issues. After all, this is dealing with derivatives and collateral, which are highly complex. Can you clean that up and potentially offer some more insight into how that function would work?', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=445, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 236777, 1006, 7107, 496, 3853, 573, 496, 17407, 6675, 528, 20615, 600, 815, 506, 3867, 17407, 13616, 236761, 1030, 795, 992, 735, 919, 614, 52233, 532, 17934, 4652, 3853, 573, 506, 1458, 692, 1161, 236764,