 57%|█████▋    | 566/1000 [01:24<02:00,  3.61it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:31 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-88acfbb27bd448c094e0010162ffe511-0: prompt: 'Software can address and solve many of the challenges that occur at each step of the month-end close process by automating and streamlining financial closing activities, providing real-time visibility into financial performance, and ensuring compliance with accounting standards and regulatory requirements.\n\n1. Data gathering and reconciliation: Accounting software can automate the process of collecting and reconciling financial data from various sources by integrating with other systems, such as time and expense tracking systems, inventory management systems, and payroll systems. This can reduce the risk of errors and increase the speed and accuracy of data collection and reconciliation. Key Performance Indicator (KPI) impacted is Data accuracy and completeness.\n2. Journal entries: Accounting software can automate the process of preparing and processing journal entries by providing pre-configured entries for common transactions, such as accruals, depreciation, amortization, and other adjusting entries. This can reduce the risk of errors and increase the speed and accuracy of journal entries. KPI impacted is the accuracy of journal entries.\n3. Account analysis: Accounting software can provide real-time visibility into financial performance by providing advanced reporting and analytics capabilities, such as financial statements, budget vs. actual reports, and variance analysis. This can help identify discrepancies and errors in financial information and improve the speed and accuracy of account analysis. KPIs impacted are the accuracy of financial information and the speed of account analysis.\n4. Reporting: Accounting software can automate the process of preparing and submitting financial reports to management and other stakeholders by providing pre-configured financial statements, compliance reports and other report types. This can improve the speed and accuracy of reporting and ensure compliance with financial reporting standards. KPI impacted is the accuracy and completeness of financial reports.\n5. Compliance and regulatory reporting: Accounting software can automate the process of preparing and filing compliance and regulatory reports by providing pre-configured reports that comply with accounting standards and legal requirements, and by providing real-time visibility into compliance status. This can improve the speed and accuracy of compliance and regulatory reporting and reduce the risk of non-compliance. KPI impacted is the compliance with accounting standards and regulatory requirements.\n6. Audit and internal controls: Accounting software can provide robust internal controls and security features, such as user access controls, role-based security, and audit trails, to ensure compliance with financial reporting standards and prevent fraud and errors. This can improve the speed and accuracy of audit and internal controls and reduce the risk of non-compliance. KPI impacted is the compliance with internal controls and financial reporting standards.\n7. Review and Approval: Accounting software can provide real-time visibility into financial performance by providing advanced reporting and analytics capabilities, such as financial statements, budget vs. actual reports, and variance analysis. This can help management to review and approve financial information and reports in a timely manner. KPI impacted is the speed of review and approval process\n8. Close the books: Accounting software can automate the process of closing the books by providing pre-configured entries for common transactions, such as accruals, depreciation, amortization, and other adjusting entries, and by providing real-time visibility into financial performance. This can improve the speed and accuracy of the close process and reduce the risk of errors. KPI impacted is the speed and accuracy of the close process\n9. Archive: Accounting software can automate the process of archiving all the financial information and reports by providing the feature of data archiving, integration with other systems like document management and providing the ability to access the archived data in real-time. This can improve the speed, accuracy and the ease of access to the archived data. KPI impacted is the speed and accuracy of data archiving\n\nBy addressing and solving the challenges at each', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=11, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 49276, 740, 3421, 532, 8974, 1551, 529, 506, 8991, 600, 4583, 657, 1546, 2918, 529, 506, 2297, 236772, 643, 3107, 1657, 684, 155745, 532, 157094, 4867, 16996, 5085, 236764, 6655, 1759, 236772, 2289, 27820, 1131, 4867, 3736, 236764, 532, 17096, 14143, 607, 18437, 8443, 532, 17286, 6035, 236761, 108, 236770, 236761, 5774, 22658, 532, 60544, 236787, 49878, 5368, 740, 62530, 506, 1657, 529, 24595, 532, 194317, 4867, 1262, 699, 3572, 7021, 684, 37803, 607, 1032, 3797, 236764, 1288, 618, 990, 532, 18766, 16074, 3797, 236764, 18241, 3997, 3797, 236764, 532, 47782, 3797, 236761, 1174, 740, 6439, 506, 4652, 529, 9825, 532, 3553, 506, 4249, 532, 10634, 529, 1262, 5249, 532, 60544, 236761, 9533, 19791, 105916, 568, 214498, 236768, 34275, 563, 5774, 10634, 532, 60755, 236761, 107, 236778, 236761, 9186, 16227, 236787, 49878, 5368, 740, 62530, 506, 1657, 529, 17373, 532, 8487, 8884, 16227, 684, 6655, 877, 236772, 126240, 16227, 573, 3364, 16788, 236764, 1288, 618, 56763, 1294, 236764, 51782, 236764, 190375, 236764, 532, 1032, 39919, 16227, 236761