INFO 09-15 16:13:38 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-b8f5c1031cc2489f8786200151bd3dea-0: prompt: 'Homeowners have several options available to them if their builder uses unsuitable building materials in their construction project. Under the Home Building Act, statutory warranties require that the builder must complete the work in a proper and workmanlike manner, and use suitable materials for the job. If the builder fails to meet these requirements, homeowners can hold them accountable and seek remedies such as requiring the builder to fix the issue or seeking compensation for the costs of rectifying the issue. Homeowners should also ensure that they have obtained the necessary insurance, including statutory warranty insurance, which can provide protection in the event of defective or incomplete work.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=28, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 9435, 27923, 735, 3131, 3835, 2487, 531, 1091, 768, 910, 17929, 6178, 91685, 3788, 5417, 528, 910, 5431, 2203, 236761, 8382, 506, 6863, 16087, 3520, 236764, 31283, 102748, 1660, 600, 506, 17929, 1921, 4133, 506, 981, 528, 496, 2005, 532, 129265, 5282, 8155, 236764, 532, 1161, 9273, 5417, 573, 506, 3195, 236761, 1637, 506, 17929, 20269, 531, 2874, 1239, 6035, 236764, 51179, 740, 2768, 1091, 46447, 532, 6370, 39854, 1288, 618, 20226, 506, 17929, 531, 7562, 506, 4186, 653, 12985, 15880, 573, 506, 5384, 529, 9319, 6323, 506, 4186, 236761, 6863, 27923, 1374, 992, 5330, 600, 901, 735, 4597, 506, 4127, 8657, 236764, 2440, 31283, 24227, 8657, 236764, 837, 740, 2847, 6733, 528, 506, 2460, 529, 40183, 653, 36289,