 63%|██████▎   | 634/1000 [01:34<01:17,  4.74it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:42 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-a16cc8866042403194a93137cf67f4a8-0: prompt: 'There are a few options to get a Disney-themed PowerPoint template:\n\n1. The Microsoft PowerPoint Template Gallery: Microsoft offers a variety of free PowerPoint templates, including some with Disney themes. To access the gallery, open PowerPoint and click on "File" > "New." In the search bar, type "Disney" or a specific Disney theme (such as "Mickey Mouse") and select the template you like.\n2. GraphicRiver: GraphicRiver is a marketplace for digital design assets, including PowerPoint templates. You can search for "Disney PowerPoint template" on the site and browse the selection of paid templates. Prices range from around $10 to $30.\n3. ThemeForest: ThemeForest is another marketplace for digital design assets, including PowerPoint templates. You can search for "Disney PowerPoint template" on the site and browse the selection of paid templates. Prices range from around $10 to $30.\n4. DIY: If you\'re feeling creative, you could create your own Disney-themed PowerPoint template using images and graphics from the web or from a site like Shutterstock or Getty Images. Just be sure to follow any copyright guidelines and attribution requirements.\n\nI hope this helps you find the perfect Disney-themed PowerPoint template for your needs!', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=12, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 3810, 659, 496, 2321, 3835, 531, 974, 496, 19047, 236772, 68122, 55559, 7930, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 669, 9265, 55559,