INFO 09-15 16:13:52 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-bbe6f4687d1b43cda5c1c20e4e06b423-0: prompt: 'now rewrite the following text considering the patent summery you wrote:\nWelcome to GMBM LTD, a revolutionary company that is changing the way people think about marine settlements. We have developed a patented product that solves two major problems: congestion in seaports and the rise in real estate prices and shortages. Our solution is simple, cheap, and effective, yet it has the potential to cause a revolution in the industry.\n\nOur patented product is the construction of sea rafts made from inside-concreted and the bottoms of containers, with the ability for movement on sea and land and the ability to connect to other rafts for making an array of rafts with power lift adaptable to different purposes. The rafts have the capability to rise and down from the platform with hydraulic freight and passenger elevators.\n\nOur mission is to revolutionize the way seaport operations and real estate development are handled. We aim to reduce congestion in seaports and provide an alternative to the high prices and shortages of traditional real estate development. Our target market includes seaport operators, shipping companies, and real estate developers.\n\nAt GMBM LTD, we believe that our solution has the potential to not only improve the efficiency of seaport operations but also provide an alternative for real estate development, and we invite you to join us in this exciting journey and be a part of the future of marine settlements. Together, we can create a better tomorrow.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=271, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens