 74%|███████▍  | 742/1000 [01:48<00:28,  9.06it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:55 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-75df4d4adcb64795a588637c55c3b877-0: prompt: "Load Wikilarge dataset\n======================\n\nwikilarge\\_train = load\\_dataset('wikitext', 'wikitext-2-raw-v1', split='train[:90%]')\nwikilarge\\_val = load\\_dataset('wikitext', 'wikitext-2-raw-v1', split='train[90%:]')\n\nPreprocess input and target sequences\n=====================================\n\ninput\\_seqs = [wikilarge\\_train[i]['text'].strip() for i in range(len(wikilarge\\_train))]\ntarget\\_seqs = [wikilarge\\_train[i]['text'].strip() for i in range(len(wikilarge\\_train))]\n\nval\\_input\\_seqs = [wikilarge\\_val[i]['text'].strip() for i in range(len(wikilarge\\_val))]\nval\\_target\\_seqs = [wikilarge\\_val[i]['text'].strip() for i in range(len(wikilarge\\_val))]\n\nTokenize input and target sequences\n===================================\n\ntokenizer = GPT2Tokenizer.from\\_pretrained('gpt2')\ninput\\_seqs = [tokenizer.encode(seq) for seq in input\\_seqs]\ntarget\\_seqs = [tokenizer.encode(seq) for seq in target\\_seqs]\nval\\_input\\_seqs = [tokenizer.encode(seq) for seq in val\\_input\\_seqs]\nval\\_target\\_seqs = [tokenizer.encode(seq) for seq in val\\_target\\_seqs]\n\nDefine training loop with REINFORCE algorithm\n=============================================\n\ndef train\\_reinforce(model, optimizer, input\\_seqs, target\\_seqs, val\\_input\\_seqs, val\\_target\\_seqs, batch\\_size, num\\_epochs):\nnum\\_batches = len(input\\_seqs) // batch\\_size\nfor epoch in range(num\\_epochs):\ntotal\\_loss = 0\nfor i in range(num\\_batches):\nstart\\_idx = i \\* batch\\_size\nend\\_idx = start\\_idx + batch\\_size\n```scss\n        input_batch = input_seqs[start_idx:end_idx]\n        target_batch = target_seqs[start_idx:end_idx]\n\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n\n        input_batch = torch.stack(input_batch).to(device)\n        target_batch = torch.stack(target_batch).to(device)\n\n        decoder_input_batch = target_batch[:, :-1].contiguous()\n        target_batch = target_batch[:, 1:].contiguous()\n\n        # Create attention mask\n        attention_mask = (input_batch != 0).type(torch.float)\n\n        # Generate sample sequence with model\n        sample_logits = model(input_batch, decoder_input_batch, attention_mask=attention_mask)\n        sample_logits = sample_logits.view(-1, sample_logits.size(-1))\n        sample_probs = F.softmax(sample_logits, dim=-1)\n        sample_log_probs = F.log_softmax(sample_logits, dim=-1)\n        sample_action = torch.multinomial(sample_probs, num_samples=1).view(-1)\n\n        # Compute REINFORCE objective\n        seq_log_prob = sample_log_probs.gather(1, sample_action.unsqueeze(1)).squeeze()\n        seq_reward = torch.zeros_like(seq_log_prob).to(device)\n        for j in range(decoder_input_batch.size(1)):\n            cur_target = target_batch[:, j]\n            cur_action = sample_action if j == 0 else decoder_input_batch[:, j-1]\n            seq_reward += (cur_target == cur_action).type(torch.float)\n\n        loss = - (seq_log_prob * seq_reward).mean()\n        loss.backward()\n\n        optimizer.step()\n\n        total_loss += loss.item()\n\n        if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\n            print(f'Epoch [{epoch+1}/{num_epochs}], Batch [{i+1}/{num_batches}], Loss: {total_loss/100:.4f}')\n            total_loss = 0\n\n    # Evaluate on validation set\n    val_accuracy = evaluate(model, val_input_seqs, val_target_seqs)\n    print(f'Epoch [{epoch+1}/{num_epochs}], Validation Accuracy: {\n```", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=878, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, ex