 77%|███████▋  | 768/1000 [01:50<00:28,  8.08it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:58 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-e39b0edcece44e9897bb854c2ec3681b-0: prompt: 'Great! Based on your new requirement, here are the updated actors and their use cases:\n\n1. User (previously Guest User and Registered User)\n* Search venues by location, name, or category\n* View venue details\n* Make a reservation\n* View reservation history\n* Cancel a reservation\n* Update personal information\n* Change password\n1. Super Admin\n* Manage venue information (add, update, delete)\n* Manage venue owner accounts (add, update, delete)\n* View analytics and reports\n1. Venue Owner / Manager (Admin)\n* Manage venue availability\n* Accept/Reject reservations\n* Update venue information\n* View analytics and reports\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=35, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 20418, 236888, 18186, 580, 822, 861, 13469, 236764, 1590, 659, 506, 10448, 20473, 532, 910, 1161, 3636, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 7486, 568, 145323, 47168, 7486, 532, 70987, 7486, 236768, 107, 236829, 12808, 37643, 684, 4563, 236764, 1463, 236764, 653, 8038, 107, 236829, 5841, 19573, 4889, 107, 236829, 9996, 496, 33391, 107, 236829, 5841, 33391, 4083, 107, 236829, 57321, 496, 33391, 107, 236829, 12579, 3577, 1938, 107, 236829, 14376, 8918, 107, 236770, 236761, 6562, 30715, 107, 236829, 54398, 19573, 1938, 568, 1282, 236764, 4610, 236764, 9311, 236768, 107, 236829, 54398, 19573, 8123, 10789, 568, 1282, 236764, 4610, 236764, 9311, 236768, 107, 236829, 5841, 26545