INFO 09-15 16:13:59 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-32cf10ec67734c8d888b9331f1676d4c-0: prompt: 'I\'m glad you provided these examples. It seems you prefer names that are simple, easy to say, and memorable. The names you\'ve mentioned are short, often with one or two syllables, and possess a certain intrigue or uniqueness.\n\nLet\'s examine each name:\n\n1. The Future - It has a forward-thinking, visionary connotation, and is simple yet impactful.\n2. Pentagram - A unique word with geometric and mystical associations, making it memorable and interesting.\n3. AJ & Smart - It combines initials with an adjective that conveys intelligence and expertise, giving it a personal and relatable touch.\n4. Blink - A short, catchy word that implies speed and intuition.\n\nBased on these characteristics, here are 10 more names to consider:\n\n1. Vision Forge\n2. Apex Studio\n3. Luminary Lab\n4. Swift & Savvy\n5. Enigma Agency\n6. Echo Design\n7. InnoWave\n8. Zephyr Studio\n9. Pixel Pioneers\n10. Fusion Works\n\nMy top 3 favorites from this list, based on your preferences, are:\n\n1. Apex Studio - It conveys a sense of being at the top or the best in the industry, and is short and easy to say.\n2. Luminary Lab - It implies that your agency is a source of inspiration and innovation, and is smooth and memorable.\n3. InnoWave - A combination of "innovation" and "wave," this name suggests forward-thinking and a continuous flow of creativity.\n\nFeel free to provide more feedback or let me know if any of these options resonate with you.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=63, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), pro