INFO 09-15 16:14:00 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-8a6e818928b3437d97b339ede3850f82-0: prompt: '"Are you ready to take your business to the next level? You\'ve found your product market fit, and now it\'s time to grow. But as you know, growing a business is easier said than done.\n\nYou may be thinking about hiring more salespeople, but let\'s be real, that\'s a six-figure investment at the minimum. And even if you do hire more salespeople, are they truly maxed out? Are their calendars fully booked? Probably not.\n\nThe truth is, even the best sales reps hate prospecting. They don\'t want to do it, and you shouldn\'t have to nag them to refill their pipeline. And if you\'re running sales for the company, you\'re likely deep in due diligence with sellers moving deals forward. Do you really have time to prospect effectively?\n\nAt Beanstalk, we understand that you want your reps in meetings, closing deals. But they don\'t want to prospect, and it\'s too expensive for you to pay them to do it. That\'s where we come in.\n\nWe specialize in demand and lead generation, ensuring that your sales reps\' calendars are always full. We have a proprietary capability that ensures high deliverability of emails to prospects, resulting in at least a 20% lift in meetings booked by month 2. And the best part? Our services are less expensive than hiring SDRs.\n\nDon\'t let prospecting hold you back from growing your business. Let Beanstalk take care of it for you. Book a free consultation today and let\'s take your business to the next level together."', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=31, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extr