INFO 09-15 16:14:00 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-fcc9d48ef3174e20bdc35a7ab6657d82-0: prompt: 'To create a mini-game that involves Ditto transformations, you can modify the existing `spawn.py` file to include the chance of spawning a Ditto transformation alongside regular Pokémon spawns. Here\'s a basic outline of how you can implement this:\n\n1. In the `Spawn` class, add a new attribute to store the Ditto transformation spawn rate:\n```python\nclass Spawn(commands.Cog):\n    def __init__(self, bot):\n        self.bot = bot\n        self.spawn_channel_id = 123456789  # Replace with your spawn channel ID\n        self.spawn_rate = 5 * 60  # Spawn a Pokémon every 5 minutes\n        self.ditto_spawn_rate = 500  # Ditto transformation spawn rate (1 in 500)\n```\n1. Modify the `spawn_pokemon` method to include the chance of spawning a Ditto transformation:\n```python\n    async def spawn_pokemon(self):\n        # Determine if a Ditto transformation should spawn\n        if random.randint(1, self.ditto_spawn_rate) == 1:\n            pokemon_name = "Ditto"\n            hint = "This is a special Ditto transformation! Guess the Pokémon it transformed into!"\n            image_url = "URL_to_Ditto_transformation_image"\n        else:\n            # Spawn a regular Pokémon\n            pokemon_name, hint, image_url = self.get_random_pokemon()\n\n        # The rest of the method remains unchanged\n```\n1. Create a new method to handle Ditto transformation guessing:\n```python\n    @commands.Cog.listener()\n    async def on_message(self, message):\n        if message.channel.id != self.spawn_channel_id or message.author.bot:\n            return\n\n        if self.is_ditto_transformation():  # You need to implement this method\n            correct = self.handle_ditto_guess(message)  # You need to implement this method\n        else:\n            correct = self.handle_pokemon_guess(message)\n\n        if correct:\n            # Reward the user and reset the spawn\n            # ...\n```\n1. Implement the `is_ditto_transformation`, `handle_ditto_guess`, and other necessary methods:\n```python\n    def is_ditto_transformation(self):\n        # Return True if the current spawn is a Ditto transformation, otherwise False\n        pass\n\n    def handle_ditto_guess(self, message):\n        # Check if the user\'s guess is correct for the Ditto transformation\n        # If the guess is correct, return True, otherwise return False\n        pass\n```\nWith these modifications, your bot will have a low chance of spawning a Ditto transformation whenever a regular Pokémon spawn occurs. You will need to provide the logic for determining the transformed Pokémon that Ditto represents and implement the guessing mechanics. Also, ensure that you update the rewards and user interactions according to the new Ditto transformation feature.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=107, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2021, 2619, 496, 11528, 236772, 5567, 600, 13842, 201157, 29913, 236764, 611, 740, 17114, 506, 6330, 2165, 65205, 236761, 2551, 236929, 2129, 531, 3204, 506, 6584, 529, 89721, 496, 201157, 11918, 16195, 4841, 46159, 171363, 3852, 236761, 5715, 236789, 236751, 496, 6079, 18161, 529, 1217, 611, 740, 4144, 672, 236787, 108, 236770, 236761, 799, 506, 2165, 54115, 236929, 1012, 236764, 1138, 496, 861, 9176, 531, 4762, 506, 201157, 11918, 36695, 3136, 236787, 107, 2717, 6719, 107, 1999, 184094, 236769, 34706, 236761, 228875, 1473, 107, 140, 2063, 5062, 2949, 10210, 1508, 236764, 9894, 1473, 107, 144, 1508, 236761, 9610, 578, 9894, 107, 144, 1508, 236761, 65205, 236