INFO 09-15 16:14:01 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-08a8399926cf4e658508c816a33e00a3-0: prompt: "Sure, here's another scenario where a trader can use the Cash front-end mobile application:\n\nScenario: A trader wants to take advantage of a market opportunity on the go\n\n1. Situation: The trader is out of the office but notices an opportunity to make a profitable trade based on real-time market data.\n2. Solution: The trader can use the Cash front-end mobile application to quickly access real-time market data, place an order, and monitor the trade on the go.\n3. Steps:\n\t* The trader logs in to the Cash application on their mobile device and navigates to the watchlist to check real-time market data for the instrument of interest.\n\t* Based on the data, the trader decides to place an order and selects the order type and product type they want to trade.\n\t* The trader specifies the order validity and submits the order, which is executed in real-time by the application.\n\t* The trader can monitor the trade's progress through the order history report and receive alerts if there are any changes in market conditions or the status of the order.\n\t* If the trade reaches the target price, the trader can close the position and take profits, all through the mobile application.\n4. Benefits:\n\t* The Cash front-end mobile application enables the trader to take advantage of market opportunities on the go, without having to be in the office or at a desktop computer.\n\t* Real-time market data and efficient trade execution make it easier for traders to make informed decisions and execute trades quickly.\n\t* The ability to monitor the trade's progress and receive alerts on the go allows traders to stay on top of market movements and adjust their strategy accordingly.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=10, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 49190, 236764, 1590, 236789, 236751, 2264, 16613, 1298, 496, 58292, 740, 1161, 506, 24531, 3645, 236772, 643, 6551, 3739, 236787, 108, 154965, 236787, 562, 58292, 8150, 531, 1769, 7821, 529, 496, 2436, 5506, 580, 506, 817, 108, 236770, 236761, 61445, 236787, 669, 58292, 563, 855, 529, 506, 4408, 840, 46725, 614, 5506, 531, 1386, 496, 29964, 5754, 2721, 580, 1759, 236772, 2289, 2436, 1262, 236761, 107, 236778, 236761, 23130, 236787, 669, 58292, 740, 1161, 506, 24531, 3645, 236772, 643, 6551, 3739, 531, 6077, 2802, 1759, 236772, 2289, 2436, 1262, 236764, 1977, 614, 1900, 236764, 532, 7020, 506, 5754, 580, 506, 817, 236761, 107, 236800, 236761, 50228, 236787, 107, 255968, 236829, 669, 58292, 25716, 528, 531, 506, 24531, 3739, 580, 910, 6551, 4744, 532, 33606, 1090, 531, 506, 169471, 531, 2426, 1759, 236772, 2289, 2436, 1262, 573, 506, 10015, 529, 2142, 236761, 107, 255968, 236829, 18186, 580, 506, 1262, 236764, 506, 58292, 35141, 531, 1977, 614, 1900, 532, 67360, 506, 1900, 1722, 532, 1698, 1722, 901, 1461, 531, 5754, 236761, 107, 255968, 236829, 669, 58292, 54945, 506, 1900, 28100, 532, 126445, 506, 1900, 236764, 837, 563, 19284, 528, 1759, 236772, 2289, 684, 506, 3739, 236761, 107, 255968, 236829, 669, 58292, 740, 7020, 506, 5754, 236789, 236751, 5609, 1343, 506, 1900, 4083, 2072, 532, 5908, 51679, 768, 993, 659, 1027, 3731, 528, 2436, 3439, 653, 506, 4981, 529, 506, 1900, 236761, 107, 255968, 236829, 1637, 506, 5754, 20881, 506, 3328, 3385, 236764, 506, 58292, 740, 3107, 506, 2939, 532, 1769, 19353, 236764, 784, 1343, 506, 6551, 3739, 236761, 107, 236812, 236761, 36767, 236787, 107, 255968, 236829, 669, 24531, 3645, 236772, 643, 6551, 3739, 17630, 506, 58292, 531, 1769, 7821, 529, 2436, 7760, 580, 506, 817,