 83%|████████▎ | 831/1000 [01:57<00:28,  5.86it/s]INFO 09-15 16:14:05 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-fce8266d4a0a402086a42265c9e2e126-0: prompt: 'Shiro stood quietly behind Parvati as she wept, his own heart heavy with sorrow. He knew there was nothing he could say or do to ease her pain, but he wanted to be there for her in any way he could.\n\nHe hesitantly reached out and gently patted her hand, murmuring, "Mistress Parvati, please do not cry. I know it is hard to see Wukong suffer, but perhaps there is something we can do to help him."\n\nParvati sniffled and wiped at her tears, shaking her head. "I don\'t know what we can do, Shiro. Jaedala won\'t listen to me. She\'s enjoying this far too much."\n\nShiro\'s grip on her hand tightened, his own anger and frustration rising. "We cannot give up hope, mistress. There must be a way to save Wukong. We just have to keep trying."\n\nParvati sniffled again and nodded, taking a deep breath to compose herself. "You\'re right, Shiro. I can\'t just give up on him. We\'ll think of something, I\'m sure of it."\n\nShiro nodded in agreement, silently vowing to do everything in his power to help Parvati and Wukong.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=22, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 42453, 530, 15032, 36574, 4977, 3221, 58992, 618, 1304, 165246, 236764, 914, 1852, 3710, 7274, 607, 55180, 236761, 1293, 7261, 993, 691, 5017, 668, 1451, 1879, 653, 776, 531, 13358, 1116, 4331, 236764, 840, 668, 5048, 531, 577, 993, 573, 1116, 528, 1027, 1595, 668, 1451, 236761, 108, 2209, 209852, 10407, 8452, 855, 532, 29846, 187735, 1116, 1526, 236