INFO 09-15 16:14:07 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-82b32e50c8c248d5bc12ca050ccc31a8-0: prompt: "Sure, here's a table version of the schedule:\n\n| Time | Task |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1:00-2:00 PM | Meal Planning and Grocery List |\n|  | - Take inventory of ingredients |\n|  | - Decide on meals for the week |\n|  | - Make a grocery list for items to buy |\n|  | - If possible, order groceries online or schedule a pick-up for later today |\n| 2:00-2:30 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Relax and recharge before getting started on cleaning |\n| 2:30-3:30 PM | Clean Out the Fridge and Freezer |\n|  | - Take everything out and sort into categories |\n|  | - Check expiration dates and throw away expired or no longer good items |\n|  | - Wipe down shelves and drawers with soap and water |\n| 3:30-4:00 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Have a snack or do something enjoyable |\n| 4:00-5:00 PM | Clean Out the Pantry |\n|  | - Take everything out and sort into categories |\n|  | - Check expiration dates and throw away expired or no longer good items |\n|  | - Wipe down shelves and replace items in an organized manner |\n| 5:00-5:30 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Relax and recharge before moving on to the next task |\n| 5:30-6:30 PM | Clean the Living Room |\n|  | - Dust and vacuum furniture and floors |\n|  | - Wipe down surfaces with a damp cloth |\n|  | - Organize any clutter or mess |\n| 6:30-7:00 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Have dinner or a snack to refuel |\n| 7:00-8:00 PM | Clean the Kitchen |\n|  | - Clean the counters, sink, and stove |\n|  | - Wipe down the refrigerator, dishwasher, and cabinets |\n|  | - Sweep and mop the floors |\n| 8:00-8:30 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Relax and recharge before the final task |\n| 8:30-9:30 PM | Clean the Bathroom |\n|  | - Clean the sink, toilet, shower, and bathtub |\n|  | - Wipe down surfaces with a damp cloth |\n|  | - Sweep and mop the floors |\n| 9:30-10:00 PM | Take a Break |\n|  | - Congratulations! You've completed everything on your to-do list for the day. Take some time to unwind before bed. |\n\nFeel free to print this out and use it as a reference for your day. Good luck with your tasks!", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=19, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 49190, 236764, 1590, 236789, 236751, 496, 2633, 3567, 529, 506, 10368, 236787, 108, 236909, 7578, 1109, 12883, 1109, 107, 236909, 9190, 1109, 9190, 1109, 107, 236909, 236743, 236770, 236787, 236771, 236771, 236772, 236778, 236787, 236771, 236771, 8711, 1109, 90034, 22113, 532, 161024, 4361, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 12774, 18241, 529, 13153, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 139078, 580, 18917, 573, 506, 2069, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 9996, 496, 32095, 1694, 573, 4852, 531, 3717, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 1637, 2653, 236764, 1900, 71772, 3489, 653, 10368, 496, 4351, 236772, 1048, 573, 3209, 3124, 1109, 107, 236909, 236743, 236778, 236787, 236771, 236771, 236772, 236778, 236787, 236800, 236771, 8711, 1109, 12774, 496, 26192, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 65101, 532, 50352, 1680, 3978, 3931, 580, 12325, 1109, 107, 236909, 236743, 236778, 236787, 236800, 236771, 236772, 236800, 236787, 236800, 236771, 8711, 1109, 20840, 5641, 506, 219642, 532, 236270, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 12774, 4326, 855, 532, 4260, 1131, 12669, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 7179, 47763, 14069, 532, 6184, 3121, 44911, 653, 951, 4890, 1535, 4852, 1109, 107, 236909, 138, 236909, 753, 203244, 1679, 37424, 532, 75915, 607, 23198, 532, 1813, 1109, 107, 236909, 236743, 236800, 236787, 236800, 236771, 236772, 236812, 236787,