 87%|████████▋ | 871/1000 [02:01<00:14,  8.87it/s]INFO 09-15 16:14:09 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-0cc0158424954c55a77be2968532723e-0: prompt: 'To give the page a more professional look, update the `index.html` file with the following code:\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>Name Converter</title>\n    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            background-color: #007bff;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .container {\n            display: flex;\n            max-width: 960px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 15px;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n        .controls {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        button {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Name Converter</h1>\n    <form action="/convert" method="POST">\n        <div class="container">\n            <div>\n                <label for="names" class="form-label">Enter names:</label>\n                <textarea id="names" name="names" rows="10" cols="50" class="form-control"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            <div class="controls">\n                <div class="form-check">\n                    <input type="checkbox" id="surnameFirst" name="surnameFirst" class="form-check-input">\n                    <label for="surnameFirst" class="form-check-label">Surname first format</label>\n                </div>\n                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Convert Names</button>\n                <button type="button" id="copyBtn" class="btn btn-secondary">Copy to Clipboard</button>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <label for="output" class="form-label">Converted Names:</label>\n                <textarea id="output" rows="10" cols="50" class="form-control" readonly></textarea>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </form>\n    <script>\n        document.querySelector(\'form\').addEventListener(\'submit\', async (e) => {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            const response = await fetch(\'/convert\', {\n                method: \'POST\',\n                headers: { \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\' },\n                body: JSON.stringify({ \n                    names: document.querySelector(\'#names\').value,\n                    surnameFirst: document.querySelector(\'#surnameFirst\').checked\n                }),\n            });\n\n            const result = await response.text();\n            document.querySelector(\'#output\').value = result;\n        });\n\n        document.querySelector(\'#copyBtn\').addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\n            const output = document.querySelector(\'#output\');\n            output.select();\n            document.execCommand(\'copy\');\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\nThe changes include:\n\n1. Adding a link to the Bootstrap 5.3.0-alpha1 CSS file from the CDN.\n2. Modifying the existing CSS rules and adding some new ones to style the page using the Bootstrap framework.\n3. Adding Bootstrap classes to form elements, such as `form-label`, `form-control`, `form-check`, `form-check-input`, `form-check-label`, `btn`, `btn-primary`, and `btn-secondary`.\n\nNow the page has a more professional appearance using the Bootstrap framework. You can further customize', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], st